"(false) become 1.0 (true).  Values > 0.0 (true) become0.0 (false)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/apdl/array_parameters.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.apdl.array_parameters.ArrayParameters.vfun:59
