"``PWR`` - Power function: ``Par1`` \\*\\* ``CON1`` . Exponentiation of any "
"negative number in the vector ``Par1`` to a non-integer power is performed "
"by exponentiating the positive number and prepending the minus sign. For "
"example, -4\\*\\*2.3 is -(4\\*\\*2.3)."
msgstr ""

