"A library of macros allows blocks of often-used commands to be stacked and "
"executed from a single file. The macro blocks must be enclosed within block "
"identifier and terminator lines as shown in this example:   **Example: Macro"
" Blocks**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/apdl/macro_files.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.apdl.macro_files.MacroFiles.ulib:67
