#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.apdl.macro_files.MacroFiles.ulib:74
msgid ""
"Commands within the macro block are copied to a temporary file (of the macro"
" block name) during the :ref:`use` operation and executed as if a macro file"
" of that name had been created. The temporary file is deleted after it has "
"been used."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/apdl/macro_files.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.apdl.macro_files.MacroFiles.ulib:78
msgid ""
"Macro block names should be acceptable file names (system-dependent) and "
"should not match user- created macro file names, as the user-created macro "
"file is used first (if it exists) before the library file is searched."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/apdl/macro_files.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.apdl.macro_files.MacroFiles.ulib:82
msgid ""
"Macro blocks may be stacked in any order. Branching ( ``*GO`` or ``*IF`` ) "
"external to the macro block is not allowed."
msgstr ""

