"input in degrees and must be positive values between 0 and 360 degrees (0 "
":math:`equation not available`  Y :math:`equation not available`  360)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/apdl/parameter_definition.pydocstring
