"``COMBI214`` element. The amplitude of the rotational velocity (OMEGS) is an"
" absolute value, so only positive values of OMEGS are valid. The "
"eccentricity (ECCENT) and phase shift (THETA) labels are only valid for "
"nonlinear analyses."
