"The number or label for the entity (as shown for ``ENTNUM`` = in the tables "
"below). In some cases, a zero (or blank) ``ENTNUM`` represents all entities "
"of the set."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/apdl/parameter_definition.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.apdl.parameter_definition.ParameterDefinition.get:20
