"The number (or label) for the specified ``Item1`` (if any). Valid ``IT1NUM``"
" values are as shown in the ``IT1NUM`` columns of the tables below. Some "
"``Item1`` labels do not require an ``IT1NUM`` value."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/apdl/parameter_definition.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.apdl.parameter_definition.ParameterDefinition.get:29
