"Effective mass of mode ``N``. Returned values are valid only after a modal "
"analysis with effective mass calculation has been solved. The direction is "
"specified using ``Item2`` = DIREC and ``IT2NUM`` = X, Y, Z, ROTX, ROTY, or "
"ROTZ."
msgstr ""

