msgid ""
"``IT1NUM`` = Crack tip node number (required)   ``Item2`` = CONTOUR   "
"``IT2NUM`` = Contour number (default 1)   ``Item3`` = DTYPE   ``IT3NUM`` = "
"Data type (JINT, IIN1, IIN2, IIN3, K1, K2, K3, G1, G2, G3, GT, MFTX, MFTY, "
