"CRDY, CRDZ, and APOS)     FOR ``IT3NUM`` = STTMAX or PSMAX:    * Item4 = "
"AINDEX (angle index)   * IT4NUM = Index value (1 to N+1; N = Maximum number "
"of intervals for the sweep (   :ref:`cint`,RSWEEP).   Returns specified data"
" type value.         FOR ``IT3NUM`` = DLTA, DLTN, DLTK, R, UFAC, CRDX, CRDY,"
