msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/apdl/parameter_definition.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.apdl.parameter_definition.ParameterDefinition.starstatus:9
msgid ""
"Specifies the parameter or sets of parameters listed. For array parameters, "
"use ``IMIN``, ``IMAX``, etc. to specify ranges. Use :ref:`dim` to define "
"array parameters. Use ``*VEDIT`` to review array parameters interactively. "
"Use :ref:`vwrite` to print array values in a formatted output. If ``Par`` is"
" blank, list all scalar parameter values, array parameter dimensions, and "
"abbreviations. If ARGX, list the active set of local macro parameters (ARG1 "
"to ARG9 and AR10 to AR99) ( :ref:`use` )."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/apdl/parameter_definition.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.apdl.parameter_definition.ParameterDefinition.starstatus:15
