"number must be defined. For example, entering these two lines:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/apdl/parameter_definition.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.apdl.parameter_definition.ParameterDefinition.vread:118
msgid ""
"will read two values from each line of file ARRAYVAL and assign the values "
"to A(1,1), A(2,1), A(3,1), etc. Reading continues until ``n1`` (10) "
"successive row elements are filled. Once the maximum row number is reached, "
"subsequent data will be read into the next column (for example, A(1,2), "
