"to the result parameter ( :ref:`vabs`, :ref:`vfact` ). Results may be "
"cumulative ( :ref:`vcum` ). See the :ref:`voper` command for details. If you"
" are in the GUI the :ref:`vread` command must be contained in an externally "
"prepared file read into Mechanical APDL (that is, :ref:`use`, :ref:`input`, "
"etc.)."
