"attribute numbers, etc., as appropriate for the item. A component name (as "
"specified on the :ref:`cm` command) may also be substituted for ``VMIN`` ( "
"``VMAX`` and ``VINC`` are ignored). If ``Item`` = MAT, TYPE, REAL, or ESYS "
