#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/database/selecting.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.database.selecting.Selecting.asel:91
msgid ""
"Selects a subset of areas. For example, to select those areas with area "
"numbers 1 through 7, use :ref:`asel`,S,AREA,,1,7. The selected subset is "
"then used when the ALL label is entered (or implied) on other commands, such"
" as :ref:`alist`,ALL. Only data identified by area number are selected. Data"
" are flagged as selected and unselected; no data are actually deleted from "
"the database."
msgstr ""

