"on node numbers 1 through 7, use :ref:`nsel`,S,NODE,,1,7. The subset is used"
" when the ALL label is entered (or implied) on other commands, such as "
":ref:`nlist`,ALL. Only data identified by node number are selected. Data are"
" flagged as selected and unselected; no data are actually deleted from the "
"database."
