"results initially calculated at the nodes (such as displacement, "
"temperature, pressure, etc.), and 2) element--results initially calculated "
"elsewhere (such as at an element integration point or thickness location) "
"and then recalculated at the nodes (such as stresses, strains, etc.). "
"Various element results also depend upon the recalculation method and the "
"selected results location ( :ref:`avprin`, :ref:`rsys`, :ref:`force`, "
":ref:`layer` and :ref:`shell` )."
