#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.graphics.labeling.Labeling.cformat:36
msgid ""
"If ``NFIRST`` is greater than zero and ``NLAST`` = 0, only the ``NFIRST`` "
"characters are displayed, followed by an ellipsis."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/graphics/labeling.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.graphics.labeling.Labeling.cformat:39
msgid ""
"If ``NFIRST`` = 0 and ``NLAST`` is greater than zero, only the ``NLAST`` "
"characters are displayed, preceded by an ellipsis (...)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/graphics/labeling.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.graphics.labeling.Labeling.cformat:42
msgid ""
"If both ``NFIRST`` and ``NLAST`` are greater than zero, the name will be "
"shown as ``NFIRST``, followed by an ellipsis (...), followed by ``NLAST``, "
"up to a maximum of 32 characters."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/graphics/labeling.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.graphics.labeling.Labeling.cformat:45
msgid ""
"For example, if ``NFIRST`` = 6 and ``NLAST`` = 3, and the character string "
"is LENGTHOFSIDEONE, then it will appear in the graphics window as "
"LENGTH...ONE."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/graphics/labeling.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.graphics.labeling.Labeling.cformat:48
msgid ""
"If the actual length of the character string is less than the specified "
"combination of ``NFIRST`` + ``NLAST`` +3, then the actual string will be "
"used."
msgstr ""

