msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/graphics/labeling.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.graphics.labeling.Labeling.udoc:14
msgid ""
"``CNTR`` - Contour legend. This legend item is controlled separately from "
"the other legend items (see note below)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/graphics/labeling.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.graphics.labeling.Labeling.udoc:17
msgid ""
"``DATE`` - The items in the DATE class include the date and time, or the "
"Mechanical APDL graphical logo ( :ref:`plopts`,LOGO,1). This item is shown "
"by default in all plots."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/graphics/labeling.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.graphics.labeling.Labeling.udoc:20
msgid ""
"``GWIN`` - The items in the GWIN class include the entity acronyms that "
"appear in the legend of a multiplot of entities (Nodes, Elements, Keypoints,"
" Lines, Areas, Volumes). GWIN items are shown by default for all "
":ref:`gplot` displays."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/graphics/labeling.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.graphics.labeling.Labeling.udoc:24
msgid ""
"``TYPE`` - Items in the TYPE class include the plot type (e.g. ELEMENTS, "
"MATERIALS, NODAL SOLUTIONS, etc.). TYPE items are shown by default in all "
"plots."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/graphics/labeling.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.graphics.labeling.Labeling.udoc:27
msgid ""
"``TYP2`` - Items in the TYP2 class include supplementary type information, "
"such as DMAX and SMAX for nodal solutions. TYP2 items are shown by default "
"in all plots."
msgstr ""

