#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.graphics.labeling.Labeling.udoc:30
msgid ""
"``INUM`` - Items in the INUM class include the number labels generated by "
"the :ref:`pnum` command. This class is displayed by default in all plots "
"that contain :ref:`pnum` information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/graphics/labeling.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.graphics.labeling.Labeling.udoc:33
msgid ""
"``BCDC`` - The items in the BCDC class include labels created by the "
":ref:`pbc` command. This class is shown by default in all plots which "
"contain :ref:`pbc` information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/graphics/labeling.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.graphics.labeling.Labeling.udoc:36
msgid ""
"``VECT`` - Items in the VECT class include labels created by the "
":ref:`plvect` command. This class is shown by default for all :ref:`plvect` "
"plots."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/graphics/labeling.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.graphics.labeling.Labeling.udoc:39
msgid ""
"``SURF`` - The items in the SURF class include labels from the :ref:`psf` "
"legend. This class is shown by default on all plots of surface boundary "
"conditions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/graphics/labeling.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.graphics.labeling.Labeling.udoc:42
msgid ""
"``BODY`` - Items from the BODY class include labels from the :ref:`pbf` "
"legend. This class is shown by default in all plots of body forces."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/graphics/labeling.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.graphics.labeling.Labeling.udoc:45
msgid ""
"``PSTA`` - Items from the PSTA class include stress scaling statistics, such"
" as the :ref:`sscale` setting. This class is not shown as the default for "
"any type of plot, and must be specifically referenced to display the "
"included data."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/graphics/labeling.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.graphics.labeling.Labeling.udoc:49
msgid ""
"``VIEW`` - The items in the VIEW class include view statistics. This class "
"is not shown as the default for any type of plot, and must be specifically "
"referenced to display the included data."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/graphics/labeling.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.graphics.labeling.Labeling.udoc:52
msgid ""
"``MISC`` - The items in the MISC class include supplementary labels like "
"/EXPANDED and Stress Section Cross Section. This class is not shown as the "
"default for any type of plot, and must be specifically referenced to display"
" the included data."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/graphics/labeling.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.graphics.labeling.Labeling.udoc:76
msgid ""
"The legend classes conform to the controls specified in the window options "
"panel ( PlotCtrls> Window Controls> Window Options ). In many instances, the"
" legend controls specified with the :ref:`plopts` command will take "
"precedence and override :ref:`udoc` specifications. For instance:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/graphics/labeling.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.graphics.labeling.Labeling.udoc:80
msgid ""
":ref:`plopts`,LEG1,OFF will disable the TYPE, TYP2, INUM, and MISC classes, "
"regardless of the :ref:`udoc` settings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/graphics/labeling.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.graphics.labeling.Labeling.udoc:83
msgid ""
":ref:`plopts`,LEG2,OFF will disable the VIEW class, regardless of the "
":ref:`udoc` settings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/graphics/labeling.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.graphics.labeling.Labeling.udoc:85
msgid ""
":ref:`plopts`,LEG3,OFF will disable the PSTA class, regardless of the "
":ref:`udoc` settings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/graphics/labeling.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.graphics.labeling.Labeling.udoc:87
msgid ""
"All items in a class are listed with the same X coordinate (except for "
"contours). The contents of the text classes are dumped onto the display "
"window from top to bottom, in order of class importance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/graphics/labeling.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.graphics.labeling.Labeling.udoc:91
msgid ""
"The font specification for text items that are included in the user-"
"specified legends are controlled with the :ref:`device` command ( PlotCtrls>"
" Font Controls> Anno/Graph Font )."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/graphics/labeling.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.graphics.labeling.Labeling.udoc:94
msgid ""
"The floating point values for the data presented in the legend(s) are "
"controlled by the :ref:`gformat` command."
msgstr ""

