" in steps of ``NINC`` (defaults to 1). If ``N1`` is blank, apply color to "
"entire selected range. If ``Lab`` is CM, use component name for ``N1`` and "
"ignore ``N2`` and ``NINC``. If ``N1`` = P, graphical picking of elements, "
"lines, areas and volumes is enabled; your can assign colors to the entities "
"via the picker. When picking is enabled, the ``Lab`` and ``Clab`` fields are"
" ignored."
