"``QUAL`` - If ``Kywrd`` = QUAL, then ``OPT`` is an integer value defining "
"the JPEG quality index on an arbitrary scale ranging from 1 to 100. The "
"default value is 75."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/graphics/set_up.pydocstring of
