"``COLOR`` - If ``Kywrd`` = COLOR, then ``OPT`` will determine the color "
"depth of the saved file. ``OPT`` can be 0, 1, or 2, corresponding to Black "
"and White, Grayscale, and Color (default), respectively."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/graphics/set_up.pydocstring of
