msgid ""
"``TMOD`` - If ``Kywrd`` = TMOD, then ``OPT`` will determine the text method."
" ``OPT`` can be either 1 or 0, corresponding to bitmap text (default) or "
"line stroke text, respectively."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/graphics/set_up.pydocstring of
