"operation ( :ref:`replot` ) or a zoom ( :ref:`zoom` ) operation. The program"
" passes the command macro arguments to the replot and zoom feature for use "
"by the graphics macro. You should place the ``s-MREP`` command at the end of"
" the graphics command macro, following the last graphics command within the "
"macro, to enable the replot or zoom feature."
msgstr ""

