#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/graphics/set_up.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.graphics.set_up.SetUp.seg:50
msgid ""
"Although the information from your graphics window is stored as an "
"individual segment, you cannot plot directly ( :ref:`gplot` ) from the "
"segment memory."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/doc/source/mapdl_commands/graphics/_autosummary/ansys.mapdl.core._commands.graphics.set_up.SetUp.show.rst:2
