#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.graphics.set_up.SetUp.window:45
msgid ""
"Copies the current specifications from window ``NCOPY`` (1 to 5) to this "
"window. If ``NCOPY`` = 0 (or blank), no specifications are copied."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/graphics/set_up.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.graphics.set_up.SetUp.window:62
msgid ""
"Defines the window size on the screen. Windows may occupy a separate section"
" of the screen or they may overlap. Requested displays are formed in all "
"windows according to the selected window specifications."
msgstr ""

