#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/graphics/style.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.graphics.style.Style.eshape:16
msgid "Scaling factor:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/graphics/style.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.graphics.style.Style.eshape:18
msgid ""
"``0`` - Use simple display of line and area elements. This value is the "
