msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/_special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1._special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.kcalc:50
msgid ""
"Calculates the stress intensity factors (K:sub:`I`, K:sub:`II`, and "
"K:sub:`III` ) associated with homogeneous isotropic linear elastic fracture "
"mechanics."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/_special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1._special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.kcalc:53
msgid ""
"A displacement extrapolation method is used in the calculation. (See `POST1 "
"- Crack Analysis (KCALC) "
"<https://ansyshelp.ansys.com/Views/Secured/corp/v232/en/ans_arch/bob143.html#eq57266024-e263-4fd8-b9d4-5ff7d2c2411a>`_"
" ``KPLAN`` = 1."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/_special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1._special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.kcalc:57
msgid ""
"The program uses minor Poisson's ratio ( :ref:`mp`,NUXY) for the stress "
"intensity factor calculation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/_special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1._special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.kcalc:60
msgid ""
"Issue the :ref:`path` and :ref:`ppath` commands to define a path with the "
"crack face nodes ( ``NODE1`` at the crack tip, ``NODE2`` and ``NODE3`` on "
"one face, ``NODE4`` and ``NODE5`` on the other (optional) face)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/_special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1._special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.kcalc:64
msgid ""
"A crack-tip coordinate system, having x parallel to the crack face (and "
"perpendicular to the crack front) and y perpendicular to the crack face, "
"must be the active :ref:`rsys` and :ref:`csys` before :ref:`kcalc` is "
"issued."
msgstr ""

