"Key to force the last sub step in a selected load step to be included in the"
" animation (defaults to 0)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/animation.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.animation.Animation.andata:36
msgid "**autocont** : :class:`python:str`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/animation.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.animation.Animation.andata:37
msgid ""
"A value of 1 enables automatic scaling of contour values based on the "
"overall subset range of values. The default value is 0 (no automatic "
"scaling)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/animation.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.animation.Animation.andata:40
msgid "**autocntr** : :class:`python:str`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/animation.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.animation.Animation.andata:41
msgid ""
"A value of 1 disables automatic centering of displaced plots. The default "
"value is 0 (allow automatic centering)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/animation.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.animation.Animation.andata:58
msgid ""
"Use the :ref:`andata` command to create animations for nonlinear problems. "
"The command works by displaying an individual graphical image for each "
"result data set from the results file. For information about creating "
"animations for linear problems, see the :ref:`anim` command."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/animation.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.animation.Animation.andata:62
msgid ""
"The command operates only on graphic display platforms supporting the "
":ref:`seg` command. It uses a macro to produce an animation based on the "
"last plot action command (for example, :ref:`pldisp` )."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/animation.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.animation.Animation.andata:65
msgid "The results file must have more than one set of results."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/animation.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.animation.Animation.andata:67
msgid ""
"The command implicitly issues :ref:`slashdscale`, 1 for default displacement"
