"with the :ref:`etable` command. Convenience labels may be used for ``Lab1`` "
"to select groups of labels (10 labels maximum): GRP1 for first 10 stored "
"items; GRP2 for items 11 to 20; GRP3 for items 21 to 30; GRP4 for items 31 "
"to 40; GRP5 for items 41 to 50. Enter :ref:`etable`,STAT command to list "
"stored item order. If all labels are blank, print first 10 stored items "
"(GRP1)."
