#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.load_case_calculations.LoadCaseCalculations.lcoper:81
msgid ""
"Absolute values and scale factors may be applied to the load cases before "
"the operations ( :ref:`lcabs`, :ref:`lcfact` ). If ``LCASE1`` is not "
"specified, only operation ``Oper`` is performed on the current database. If "
"``LCASE2`` is specified, operation ``Oper2`` is performed before operation "
"``Oper``. If ``LCASE2`` is not specified, operation ``Oper2`` is ignored."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/load_case_calculations.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.load_case_calculations.LoadCaseCalculations.lcoper:86
msgid ""
"Solution items not contained ( :ref:`outres` ) in either the database or the"
" applicable load cases will result in a null item during a load case "
"operation. Harmonic element data read from a result file load case are "
"processed at zero degrees."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/load_case_calculations.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.load_case_calculations.LoadCaseCalculations.lcoper:90
msgid ""
"Load case combinations must be performed on load cases from the same results"
" file. Combining load cases from different results files is not supported."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/load_case_calculations.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.load_case_calculations.LoadCaseCalculations.lcoper:93
msgid ""
"Load case combinations of element-based solutions are performed in the "
"solution coordinate system, and the data resulting from load case "
"combinations are stored in the solution coordinate system. The resultant "
"data are then transformed to the active results coordinate system ( "
":ref:`rsys` ) when listed or displayed. Except in the cases of ``Oper`` = "
"LPRIN, ADD, or SUB, you must use :ref:`rsys`,SOLU to list or display "
"results. In the case of layered elements, the layer ( :ref:`layer` ) must "
"also be specified."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/load_case_calculations.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.load_case_calculations.LoadCaseCalculations.lcoper:100
msgid ""
"If `nodal-averaged results "
"<https://ansyshelp.ansys.com/Views/Secured/corp/v232/en/ans_elem/Hlp_E_CH2_2.html#nodeavepost>`_"
" are a part of the load case combination, the resulting nodal-averaged "
"result data are in the global Cartesian coordinate system. Furthermore, the "
"resulting numerical values may differ from the same :ref:`lcoper` operation "
"performed on the same data stored as element results. The SQUA, SQRT, LPRIN,"
" and SRSS operations are not valid when applied to nodal averaged results. "
"For more information, see `Nodal-Averaged Results "
"<https://ansyshelp.ansys.com/Views/Secured/corp/v232/en/ans_elem/Hlp_E_CH2_2.html#nodeavepost>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/load_case_calculations.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.load_case_calculations.LoadCaseCalculations.lcoper:109
msgid ""
"Use the :ref:`force` command prior to any combination operation to correctly"
" combine the requested force type."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/load_case_calculations.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.load_case_calculations.LoadCaseCalculations.lcoper:112
msgid ""
"If Oper2=CPXMAX, the derived stresses and strain calculation do not apply to"
" line elements."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/load_case_calculations.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.load_case_calculations.LoadCaseCalculations.lcoper:117
msgid ""
"For cyclic symmetry ( :ref:`cyclic` ), :ref:`lcoper` operates on the raw "
"base and duplicate sector values. It cannot be used on the expanded values ("
" :ref:`cycexpand` )."
msgstr ""

