"``UNIFORM`` - Maps uniform divisions (specified on the ``nDiv`` argument of "
"the :ref:`path` command) between specified points. This is the default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/path_operations.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.path_operations.PathOperations.pmap:14
msgid ""
"``ACCURATE`` - Map geometry using a small division at the beginning and end "
"of each segment. This gives you accurate derivatives, integrals, tangents, "
"and normals for curves which do not have continuous slopes at the specified "
"points. To create nonuniform divisions, the ``nDiv`` argument of the "
":ref:`path` command must be greater than 2."
