"Sets mapping for discontinuities in the field. The divisions are modified to"
" put a point just before and just after the discontinuity. The valid label "
"is MAT, for a material discontinuity. No discontinuity is the default. "
"Discontinuity mapping involves the NOAV option on the :ref:`pdef` command."
msgstr ""

