"vector."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/path_operations.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.path_operations.PathOperations.pvect:44
msgid ""
"Defines and interpolates a set of labeled path items along predefined path ("
" :ref:`path` ) and performs various geometric operations on these path "
"items. A path item must be defined before it can be used with other path "
"operations. Additional path items may be defined with the :ref:`pdef`, "
":ref:`pcalc`, :ref:`pdot`, and :ref:`pcross` commands. Path items may be "
"listed or displayed with the :ref:`plpath`, :ref:`plpagm` and :ref:`prpath` "
"commands. Path geometry items (XG, YG, ZG, S) are automatically interpolated"
" (in the active CSYS) if not done so previously with the :ref:`pdef` "
"command."
msgstr ""

