"Setting ``ITEM`` = CONT will only account for nodal forces on selected "
"contact elements ( ``CONTA172``, ``CONTA174``, ``CONTA175``, and "
"``CONTA177`` ). Setting ``ITEM`` = BOTH will account for nodal forces on all"
" selected nodes, including contact nodes."
msgstr ""

