" element coordinate systems into the appropriate cylindrical system ( "
"``EMODIF,,ESYS`` ) before running the solution and then view the results in "
"this system ( ``RSYS,SOLU`` ) in POST1."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/set_up.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.set_up.SetUp.hrcplx:78
msgid ""
"Since :ref:`hrcplx` performs load case combinations, it alters most of the "
"data in the database. In particular, it alters applied loads such as forces "
"and imposed displacements. To restore the original loads in the database for"
" a subsequent analysis, reissue the :ref:`set` command in POST1 to retrieve "
"the real and imaginary set data."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/set_up.pydocstring of
