#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.nldpost:4
msgid ""
"Mechanical APDL Command: `NLDPOST "
"<https://ansyshelp.ansys.com/Views/Secured/corp/v232/en//ans_cmd/Hlp_C_NLDPOST.html>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.nldpost:9
msgid "Specifies the type of command operation:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.nldpost:11
msgid "``EFLG`` - Element flag for nonlinear diagnostics."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.nldpost:13
msgid "``NRRE`` - Newton-Raphson residuals."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.nldpost:16
msgid "Specifies the command action:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.nldpost:18
msgid ""
"``STAT`` - List information about the diagnostic files ( "
":file:`Jobname.ndxxx` or :file:`Jobname.nrxxx` ) in the current directory."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.nldpost:21
msgid ""
"For ``Label`` = EFLG, the listing gives a summary that associates the "
"loadstep, substep, time, equilibrium iteration number, cumulative iteration "
"number, and the number of elements that fail each criteria with a specific "
"file ID ( :file:`Jobname.ndxxx` ). Use the list to create element components"
" (via the CM option) based on the cumulative iteration number."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.nldpost:26
msgid ""
"For ``Label`` = NRRE, the listing provides a summary that associates the "
"loadstep, substep, time, equilibrium iteration number, and cumulative "
"iteration number with a specific file ID ( :file:`Jobname.nrxxx` ). Use the "
"list to identify the respective file ID for creating Newton-Raphson residual"
" contour plots ( :ref:`plnsol`,NRRE,..., ``FileID`` )."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.nldpost:31
msgid ""
"``DEL`` - Delete :file:`Jobname.ndxxx` or :file:`Jobname.nrxxx` files in the"
" working directory, if any exist."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.nldpost:34
msgid ""
"``CM`` - Create components for elements that violate criteria. This value is"
" valid only when ``Label`` = EFLG."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.nldpost:38
msgid ""
"Valid only when ``Label`` = EFLG and ``Key`` = CM, this value specifies file"
" IDs:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.nldpost:40
msgid ""
"``IDnum`` - The file ID number. Creates the element components from the "
"diagnostic files corresponding to the specified file ID number in the "
"working directory."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.nldpost:43
msgid ""
"``ALL`` - Creates element components from all available diagnostic files "
"residing in the working directory. This value is the default if you do not "
"specify an ``IDnum`` value."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.nldpost:46
msgid "**prefix** : :class:`python:str`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.nldpost:47
msgid ""
"Sets the prefix name for components. Specify up to 21 alphanumeric "
"characters."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.nldpost:63
msgid ""
"Based on the nonlinear diagnostic results (created via the "
":ref:`nldiag`,EFLG command), the :ref:`nldpost` command creates element "
"components with predefined names."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.nldpost:66
msgid ""
"The following table lists the diagnostic criteria and component names (with "
"specified prefix and without). Here ``xxx`` corresponds to the file ID ( "
"``FileID`` ) of :file:`Jobname.ndxxx` or :file:`Jobnamenrxxx`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.nldpost:73
msgid ""
"If you have trouble viewing specific element components, see `Viewing Hidden"
" Element Components "
"<https://ansyshelp.ansys.com/Views/Secured/corp/v232/en/ans_bas/Hlp_G_BAS7_4.html#>`_"
msgstr ""

