#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.plzz:15
msgid ""
"Adds speed lines about the ``RotVel`` speed line corresponding to ``RotVel``"
" ± ``DeltaRotVel``. Only plotted if ``RotVel`` is known."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.plzz:32
msgid ""
":ref:`plzz` plots the cyclic modal frequencies as points on a frequency vs. "
"harmonic index (nodal diameter) graph. If rotational speed ( ``RotVel`` ) is"
" provided, the speed line is also plotted, leading to the interference "
"diagram (also known as the SAFE or ZZENF diagram). If ``DeltaRotVel`` is "
"also provided, two additional speed lines are plotted, enveloping the safe "
"speed line itself."
msgstr ""

