"to solutions obtained with the damped eigensolver ( ``Method`` =DAMP on the "
":ref:`modopt` command):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.prcamp:72
msgid ""
"``0 (OFF, or NO)`` - Only positive frequencies are printed out. This value "
"is the default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.prcamp:74
msgid ""
"``1 (ON, or YES)`` - Negative and positive frequencies are printed out."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.prcamp:76
