#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.rsplit:14
msgid ""
"``ALL`` - Write all nodal and element results based on the subset of "
"elements (default)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.rsplit:16
msgid ""
"``EXT`` - Write only the nodal and element results that are on the exterior "
"surface of the element subset. The results data will be averaged as in "
"PowerGraphics (see :ref:`avres` ) when this results file is brought into "
"POST1. Only valid for solid elements."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.rsplit:21
