"be based on nodes. If unspecified, all nodes are matched and used for MAC "
"calculations. If a component name is specified, only nodes included in the "
"specified component are used. Not applicable to node mapping ( ``Option`` = "
"NODMAP on :ref:`macopt`  )."
msgstr ""

