"the frequency domain for criteria calculations. The printout options consist"
" of listing the table of the criterion results for each frequency in the "
"frequency domain ( ``KeyPrint`` = 0, 1, or 2) and the matched nodes table ( "
"``KeyPrint`` = 2)."
