"You can use the :ref:`slashexpand` command to perform up to three symmetry "
"expansions at once (that is, X, Y, and Z which is equal to going from a 1/8 "
"model to a full model). Polar expansions allow you to expand a wheel section"
" into a half wheel, then into the half section, and then into the whole."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.slashexpand:172
