#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.slashexpand:175
msgid ""
"The command works on all element and result displays, except as noted below."
" As the graphic display is created, the elements (and results) are repeated "
"as many times as necessary, expanding the geometry and, if necessary, the "
"displacements and stresses."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.slashexpand:179
