"It does not average nodal results across sector boundaries, even for "
"averaged plots (such as those obtained via the :ref:`plnsol` command)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.slashexpand:192
