#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.slashexpand:197
msgid ""
"The uses of :ref:`slashexpand` are of a more general nature, whereas the "
":ref:`expand` command is intended primarily to expand modal cyclic symmetry "
"results."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post1/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post1.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.slashexpand:200
