"Changes the meaning of the time variable to the cumulative iteration number "
"(NCUMIT) variable. Data can be read from the file, printed, and displayed as"
" a function of NCUMIT rather than time. All POST26 descriptions applying to "
"TIME then apply to NCUMIT."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/doc/source/mapdl_commands/post26/_autosummary/ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post26.display.Display.keep.rst:2
