msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post26/display.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post26.display.Display.keep:4
msgid ""
"Mechanical APDL Command: `KEEP "
"<https://ansyshelp.ansys.com/Views/Secured/corp/v232/en//ans_cmd/Hlp_C_KEEP.html>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post26/display.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post26.display.Display.keep:9
msgid "State or value"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post26/display.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post26.display.Display.keep:11
msgid ""
"``On or 1`` - Allows you to exit and reenter :ref:`post26` without losing "
"your current time history variable information. Keeps a cache of the "
":ref:`post26` variable information including the active file name ( "
":ref:`file` ), variable definitions ( :ref:`nsol`, :ref:`esol`, "
":ref:`rforce`, and :ref:`solu` ) and stored variable data in memory for the "
"current Mechanical APDL session."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post26/display.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post26.display.Display.keep:16
msgid ""
"``Off or 0`` - :ref:`post26` variable information is deleted when you exit "
":ref:`post26`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post26/display.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post26.display.Display.keep:32
msgid ""
"Your variable information is saved in memory only for the current active "
"Mechanical APDL session. It is deleted when you exit Mechanical APDL. This "
"information is also deleted when you issue :ref:`clear`, :ref:`resume`, "
":ref:`solve`, or :ref:`reset`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post26/display.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post26.display.Display.keep:37
msgid ""
"When you reenter :ref:`post26` all time history variable data is available "
"for use. When you issue :ref:`store`, NEW, variable definitions created by "
"math operations such as :ref:`add` or :ref:`prod` will not be restored. "
"However, variables defined with :ref:`nsol`, :ref:`esol`, :ref:`rforce`, and"
" :ref:`solu`  will be restored. Only the last active results file name is "
"kept in memory ( :ref:`file` )."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/post26/display.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.post26.display.Display.keep:43
msgid ""
"Commands such as :ref:`layerp26`, :ref:`shell`, and :ref:`force` that "
"specify the location or a component of data to be stored will retain the "
"setting at the time of exiting :ref:`post26`."
msgstr ""

