"and mesh) from a pattern of areas. The MAT, TYPE, REAL, and ESYS attributes "
"are based on the areas in the pattern and not the current settings. Scaling "
"is done in the active coordinate system. Areas in the pattern could have "
"been generated in any coordinate system. However, solid modeling in a "
"toroidal coordinate system is not recommended."
