"and ``NINC`` are ignored and the pattern is all selected areas ( :ref:`asel`"
" ). If ``Ncomp`` = P, use graphical picking to specify areas and ignore "
"``NL2`` and ``NINC``. A component name may also be substituted for ``NA1`` ("
