"transferred. Transfer occurs from the active coordinate system. The "
"coordinate system type and parameters of ``KCNTO`` must be the same as the "
"active system."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/areas.pydocstring of
