#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/areas.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.areas.Areas.atran:28
msgid ""
"Transfer area pattern beginning with ``NA1`` to ``NA2`` (defaults to ``NA1``"
" ) in steps of ``NINC`` (defaults to 1). If ``NA1`` = ALL, ``NA2`` and "
"``NINC`` are ignored and the pattern is all selected areas ( :ref:`asel` ). "
"If ``NA1`` = P, graphical picking is enabled and all remaining arguments are"
" ignored (valid only in the GUI). A component name may also be substituted "
"for ``NA1`` ( ``NA2`` and ``NINC`` are ignored)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/areas.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.areas.Areas.atran:39
