"The original lines (and their corresponding keypoint(s)) will be deleted by "
"default. See the :ref:`boptn` command for the options available to Boolean "
"operations. Element attributes and solid model boundary conditions assigned "
"to the original entities will not be transferred to the new entities "
"generated."
msgstr ""

