msgid ""
"Adds separate volumes to create a single volume. The original volumes (and "
"their corresponding areas, lines and keypoints) will be deleted by default ("
" :ref:`boptn` ). See the :ref:`boptn` command for the options available to "
"Boolean operations. Element attributes and solid model boundary conditions "
"assigned to the original entities will not be transferred to the new "
"entities generated. Concatenated entities are not valid with this command."
msgstr ""

