"the equation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/constraint_equations.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.constraint_equations.ConstraintEquations.ce:28
msgid ""
"Degree of freedom label for first term of equation. Structural labels: UX, "
"UY, or UZ (displacements); ROTX, ROTY, or ROTZ (rotations, in radians). "
"Thermal labels: TEMP, TBOT, TE2, TE3, ..., TTOP (temperature). Electric "
"labels: VOLT (voltage). Magnetic labels: MAG (scalar magnetic potential); AZ"
" (vector magnetic potential). Diffusion label: CONC (concentration)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/constraint_equations.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.constraint_equations.ConstraintEquations.ce:34
msgid ""
"Coefficient for first node term of equation. If zero, this term is ignored."
msgstr ""

