#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.constraint_equations.ConstraintEquations.cecycms:28
msgid ""
"Option to use mapping when creating cyclic symmetry constraint equations. "
"This option is ignored if you specify ``UsrNMap``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/constraint_equations.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.constraint_equations.ConstraintEquations.cecycms:31
msgid ""
"``ON`` - Use mapping to relate low and high sector boundary DOFs when "
"applying cyclic symmetry constraint equations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/constraint_equations.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.constraint_equations.ConstraintEquations.cecycms:34
msgid ""
"``OFF`` - Use matching node pairs from low and high sector boundaries to "
"apply cyclic symmetry constraint equations (default)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/constraint_equations.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.constraint_equations.ConstraintEquations.cecycms:38
msgid ""
"Tolerance for determining if one node on the low edge boundary matches the "
"corresponding node on the high edge boundary after the nodes are rotated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/constraint_equations.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.constraint_equations.ConstraintEquations.cecycms:41
msgid ""
"``If positive`` - ``TOLER`` is absolute (length units, defaults to 1e-4 ). "
"If the distance of the nodes is smaller than this absolute tolerance, the "
"nodes are matched."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/constraint_equations.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.constraint_equations.ConstraintEquations.cecycms:44
msgid ""
"``If negative`` - ``TOLER`` is relative. Considering the diagonal of an "
"imaginary box enclosing the model, ``TOLER`` is a fraction of the length of "
"that diagonal. Nodes within the relative tolerance are matched."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/constraint_equations.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.constraint_equations.ConstraintEquations.cecycms:48
msgid "**kprint** : :class:`python:int` or :class:`python:str`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/constraint_equations.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.constraint_equations.ConstraintEquations.cecycms:49
msgid ""
"Option to print the table of matched nodes ( ``KMAP`` = OFF) or mapped nodes"
" and elements ( ``KMAP`` = ON)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/constraint_equations.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.constraint_equations.ConstraintEquations.cecycms:52
