"Defaults to label previously defined with ``NSET`` if set ``NSET`` already "
"exists. A different label redefines the previous label associated with "
"``NSET``. Valid labels are: Structural labels: UX, UY, or UZ "
"(displacements); ROTX, ROTY, or ROTZ (rotations) (in radians); HDSP "
"(hydrostatic pressure). Thermal labels: TEMP, TBOT, TE2, TE3, ..., TTOP "
"(temperature). Fluid labels: PRES (pressure); VX, VY, or VZ (velocities). "
"Electric labels: VOLT (voltage); EMF (electromotive force drop); CURR "
"(current). Magnetic labels: MAG (scalar magnetic potential); AZ (vector "
"magnetic potential); CURR (current). Diffusion label: CONC (concentration)."
msgstr ""

