"(defaults to 1). If ``NODE1`` = P, graphical picking is enabled and all "
"remaining command fields are ignored (valid only in the GUI). If - "
"``NODE1``, delete range of nodes from set instead of including. A component "
"name may also be substituted for ``NODE1`` ( ``NODE2`` and ``NINC`` are "
"ignored)."
msgstr ""

