"``NSET1`` ) in steps of ``NINC`` (defaults to 1). If ``NSET1`` is negative, "
"``NSET2`` and ``NINC`` are ignored and the last \\| ``NSET1`` \\| sets (in "
"sequence from the maximum set number) are used as the sets to be repeated."
msgstr ""

