"``CONTA172``, ``CONTA174``, and ``CONTA175``. It applies to cases where the "
"original meshes of contact elements are located on a portion of a bolt-"
"thread surface. This feature allows you to include the behavior of bolt "
"threads without having to add the geometric detail of the threads. "
"Calculations are performed internally to approximate the behavior of the "
"bolt-thread connections."
