#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.cross_sections.CrossSections.secjoint:289
msgid ""
"The command :ref:`secjoint`,PNLT is only applicable to penalty-based joints "
"(KEYOPT(2) = 1 on most joint elements). The default penalty factor (common "
"to all constraints of the joint element) is of the order of "
"10\\2E:sub:`avg`, where E:sub:`avg` is the average Young``s modulus of the "
"elements attached to the joint element or deduced from the connections to "
"other elements. The default value may be overridden by specifying user-"
"defined penalty factors via :ref:`secjoint`,PNLT. The choice of penalty "
"factors can affect the constraint satisfaction as well as overall solution "
"convergence."
msgstr ""

