"Factor to increase transverse shear flexibility in the element x-z plane. "
"The default value is 1.0."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/cross_sections.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.cross_sections.CrossSections.sflex:26
