#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/data_tables.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.data_tables.DataTables.cgrow:347
msgid ""
"MIN or MAX or AVER or blank (default) - The minimum, maximum, or average "
"stress-intensity-factor range (ΔK), respectively. The program calculates the"
" range over the entire crack front, then uses the result to evaluate the "
"threshold criterion. The entire crack is arrested if the specified minimum, "
"maximum, or average ΔK is below the threshold ( ``Par2`` ). Partial crack-"
"growth does not occur."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/data_tables.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.data_tables.DataTables.cgrow:353
msgid ""
"If ``Par3`` is unspecified (default), the program evaluates threshold "
"criterion at each crack-front node individually and ensures that the crack "
"is arrested locally at any node where ΔK is below the threshold ( ``Par2`` "
"). If some nodes have ΔK less than the threshold and others have ΔK greater "
"than the threshold, partial crack-growth occurs at the crack front."
msgstr ""

