msgid ""
"The command can also be used with ``MESH200`` (via the `mesh-independent "
"method "
"<https://ansyshelp.ansys.com/Views/Secured/corp/v232/en/ans_str/strreinfworkflow.html#strinistmesh200>`_"
" for defining `reinforcing "
"<https://ansyshelp.ansys.com/Views/Secured/corp/v232/en/ans_str/str_compreinfdirectemb.html>`_"
" ) to apply an initial state to all generated reinforcing elements "
"automatically. For more information, see `Applying an Initial State to "
"Reinforcing Elements "
"<https://ansyshelp.ansys.com/Views/Secured/corp/v232/en/ans_str/strreinfworkflow.html#strinistmesh200>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/data_tables.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.data_tables.DataTables.inistate:91
msgid ""
"Initial-state support for a given element is indicated in the documentation "
"for the element under **Special Features**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/data_tables.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.data_tables.DataTables.inistate:94
msgid ""
"Initial-strain input ( :ref:`inistate`,SET,DTYPE,EPEL) enables the nonlinear"
" solver option automatically even if no nonlinear materials are involved."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/data_tables.pydocstring
