"``Action`` = SET specifies and modifies the environment into which you will "
"define the initial-state data (via a subsequent :ref:`inistate`,DEFINE "
"command). Otherwise, subsequent :ref:`inistate`,DEFINE data is input as "
"initial stress data in the global Cartesian coordinate system."
