#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/data_tables.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.data_tables.DataTables.inistate:182
msgid ""
"Node number when using node-based initial state. Defaults to current node "
"selection."
msgstr ""

