#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/data_tables.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.data_tables.DataTables.inistate:205
msgid ""
"For coupled-field elements, the stresses to input must be Biot's effective "
"stresses."
