"The n  can be 1, 4, or 6. For example, JNF4 plots only the nonlinear "
"hysteretic friction data specified in local direction 4 (ROTX)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/data_tables.pydocstring
