#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.data_tables.DataTables.tbpt:47
msgid ""
":ref:`tbpt` defines a point on a nonlinear data curve (such as a stress-"
"strain curve, B-H curve, etc.) at the temperature specified on the last "
":ref:`tbtemp` command. The meaning of the values depends on the type of data"
" table specified on the last :ref:`tb` command."
msgstr ""

