#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/data_tables.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.data_tables.DataTables.tbtemp:29
msgid ""
"The :ref:`tbtemp` command defines a temperature to be associated with the "
"data on subsequent :ref:`tbpt` or :ref:`tbdata` commands."
