#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/database.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.database.Database.numstr:17
msgid ""
"``KP`` - Keypoint numbers. ``Value`` defaults to 1. Only undefined numbers "
"are used. Existing keypoints are not overwritten."
