#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/database.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.database.Database.numstr:23
msgid ""
"``AREA`` - Area numbers. ``Value`` defaults to 1. Only undefined numbers are"
