#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.database.Database.numstr:48
msgid ""
"Establishes starting numbers for various items that may have numbers "
"automatically assigned (such as element numbers with the :ref:`egen` "
"command, and node and solid model entity numbers with the mesh like "
":ref:`amesh`, :ref:`vmesh`, etc.. Use :ref:`numstr`,STAT to display "
"settings. Use :ref:`numstr`,DEFA to reset all specifications back to "
"defaults. Defaults may be lowered by deleting and compressing items (that "
"is, :ref:`ndele` and :ref:`numcmp`,NODE for nodes, etc.)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/database.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.database.Database.numstr:54
msgid ""
"A mesh clear operation ( :ref:`vclear`, :ref:`aclear`, :ref:`lclear`, and "
":ref:`kclear` ) automatically sets starting node and element numbers to the "
"highest unused numbers. If a specific starting node or element number is "
"desired, issue :ref:`numstr` after the clear operation."
msgstr ""

