"Delete elements from ``IEL1`` to ``IEL2`` (defaults to ``IEL1`` ) in steps "
"of ``INC`` (defaults to 1). If ``IEL1`` = ALL, ``IEL2`` and ``INC`` are "
"ignored and all selected elements ( :ref:`esel` ) are deleted. If ``IEL1`` ="
" P, graphical picking is enabled and all remaining command fields are "
"ignored (valid only in the GUI). A component name may also be substituted "
"for ``IEL1`` ( ``IEL2`` and ``INC`` are ignored)."
msgstr ""

