#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/elements.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.elements.Elements.edele:43
msgid ""
"Deleted elements are replaced by null or \"blank\" elements. Null elements "
"are used only for retaining the element numbers so that the element "
"numbering sequence for the rest of the model is not changed by deleting "
"elements. Null elements may be removed (although this is not necessary) with"
" the :ref:`numcmp` command. If related element data (pressures, etc.) are "
"also to be deleted, delete that data before deleting the elements. "
":ref:`edele` is for unattached elements only. You can use the **xCLEAR** "
"family of commands to remove any attached elements from the database."
msgstr ""

