"Define nodes that do not already exist but are needed by generated elements "
"(as though the :ref:`ngen`, ``ITIME,INC,NODE1,,,DX,DY,DZ`` were issued "
"before :ref:`egen` ). Zero is a valid value. If blank, ``DX``, ``DY``, and "
"``DZ`` are ignored."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/elements.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.elements.Elements.egen:96
