"refer to the `command documentation "
"<https://ansyshelp.ansys.com/Views/Secured/corp/v232/en//ans_cmd/Hlp_C_EINFIN.html>`_"
" for further information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/elements.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.elements.Elements.einfin:31
msgid "**nref2** : :class:`python:str`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/elements.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.elements.Elements.einfin:32
msgid ""
"Node number of the second reference node used to calculate pole positions. "
"(A parameter or parametric expression is also valid.) Specify this value "
"when no ``CompName`` has been specified. (If ``CompName`` is specified, this"
" value is ignored.) To input this value, first specify ``NREF1`` (replacing "
"``PNODE`` ). Pole positions are calculated on an infinite line defined by "
"``NREF1`` and ``NREF2``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/elements.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.elements.Elements.einfin:38
