#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/elements.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.elements.Elements.eintf:9
msgid ""
"Tolerance for coincidence (based on maximum Cartesian coordinate difference "
"for node locations and on angle differences for node orientations). Defaults"
" to 0.0001. Only nodes within the tolerance are considered to be coincident."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/elements.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.elements.Elements.eintf:14
msgid ""
"Only used when the type of the elements to be generated is ``PRETS179``. "
"``K`` is the pretension node that is common to the pretension section that "
"is being created. If ``K`` is not specified, it is created automatically and"
" will have an Mechanical APDL-assigned node number. If ``K`` is specified "
"but does not already exist, it will be created automatically but will have "
"the user- specified node number. ``K`` cannot be connected to any existing "
"element."
msgstr ""

