":ref:`emore` command, it may be necessary to turn off shape checking using "
"the :ref:`shpp` command before issuing this command. If a valid element type"
" can be created without using the additional nodes on the :ref:`emore` "
"command, this command will create that element. The :ref:`emore` command "
"will then modify the element to include the additional nodes. If shape "
