"be seen using :ref:`psymb`,LAYR. To use :ref:`psymb`,LAYR with smeared "
"reinforcing elements ( ``REINF265`` ), first set the vector-mode graphics "
"option ( :ref:`device`,VECTOR,1)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/elements.pydocstring of
