" default, adaptive meshing is OFF for all parts in the model. To specify "
"adaptive meshing for more than one part in the model, you must issue the "
"EDADAPT command for each part ID. Use the EDPART command to create and list "
"valid part IDs. Use the EDCADAPT command to define additional adaptive "
"meshing parameters."
