"Note: When you delete a contact definition with the EDDC command, the "
"contact entity numbers will be renumbered for the remaining contact "
"definitions. Therefore, you should always issue EDCLIST to obtain a current "
"list of contact entity numbers before adding or deleting contact parameters "
"with the EDCMORE command."
