#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.explicit_dynamics.ExplicitDynamics.eddc:53
msgid ""
"You cannot delete contact specifications in an explicit dynamic small "
"restart (EDSTART,2). However, you can use Option = DACT to deactivate a "
"contact definition that is not needed in the small restart. That contact "
"definition may then be reactivated in a subsequent small restart by using "
"Option = RACT."
msgstr ""

