#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.explicit_dynamics.ExplicitDynamics.eddc:62
msgid ""
"The EDDC command is not supported in an explicit dynamic full restart "
"analysis (EDSTART,3). Thus, you cannot delete, deactivate, or reactivate "
"contact specifications in a full restart that were defined in the previous "
"analysis."
msgstr ""

