"Use EDHIST,LIST to list the time-history output specification. (The listing "
"will include output requested with the EDOUT command.) Use EDHIST,DELE to "
"delete the time-history output specification."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/explicit_dynamics.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.explicit_dynamics.ExplicitDynamics.edhist:35
msgid ""
"Jobname.HIS is a binary file that is read by the ANSYS time-history "
"postprocessor (POST26). If LS-DYNA output has been requested on the EDWRITE "
"command [EDWRITE,LSDYNA or EDWRITE,BOTH], the file D3THDT will also be "
"written. D3THDT is a binary file that is read by the LS-POST postprocessor."
msgstr ""

