msgid ""
"This command specifies output to be written during an explicit dynamics "
"solution. The data corresponding to each Option is written to a separate "
"ASCII file having the same name as the Option label. The data is written for"
" the entire model at time intervals specified by the EDHTIME command. If no "
"time interval is specified, output is written at 1000 steps over the "
"analysis. (See also the EDHIST command which specifies time-history output "
"for a portion of the model.)  The data written to the MATSUM file is "
"actually for each PART number (EDPART) at time intervals specified by the "
"EDHTIME command, but the data is listed following the Mat no. in the file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/explicit_dynamics.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.explicit_dynamics.ExplicitDynamics.edout:69
