"In order for the specified output files to be written, you must also request"
" that explicit dynamics results be written to an LS-DYNA output file "
"[EDWRITE,LSDYNA or EDWRITE,BOTH]."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/explicit_dynamics.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.explicit_dynamics.ExplicitDynamics.edout:81
msgid ""
"In an explicit dynamic small restart analysis (EDSTART,2) or full restart "
"analysis (EDSTART,3), the same ASCII files that were requested for the "
"original analysis are written by default for the restart. You can request "
"different files by issuing the appropriate EDOUT commands in the restart "
"analysis."
msgstr ""

