"well as the current coordinate system offsets from ``KP1`` to ``KP2``, where"
" the X, Y, and Z locations of ``KP1`` are subtracted from the X, Y, and Z "
"locations of ``KP2`` (respectively) to determine the offsets. :ref:`kdist` "
"is valid in any coordinate system except toroidal ( :ref:`csys`,3)."
msgstr ""

