"distance value. You can use this value for various purposes; for example, to"
" set the default number of line divisions to be generated along region "
"boundary lines ( :ref:`esize`, ``_RETURN`` ). In interactive mode, you can "
"access this command by using the Model Query Picker ( Utility Menu> List> "
"Picked Entities ), where you can also access automatic annotation functions,"
" and display the value on your model."
