#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/keypoints.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.keypoints.Keypoints.kscale:2
msgid "Generates a scaled pattern of keypoints from a given keypoint pattern."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/keypoints.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.keypoints.Keypoints.kscale:4
msgid ""
"Mechanical APDL Command: `KSCALE "
"<https://ansyshelp.ansys.com/Views/Secured/corp/v232/en//ans_cmd/Hlp_C_KSCALE.html>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/keypoints.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.keypoints.Keypoints.kscale:9
msgid ""
"Do this scaling operation one time, incrementing all keypoints in the given "
"pattern by ``KINC``. If ``KINC`` = 0, keypoints will be redefined at the "
"scaled locations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/keypoints.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.keypoints.Keypoints.kscale:13
#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/keypoints.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.keypoints.Keypoints.kscale:20
#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/keypoints.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.keypoints.Keypoints.kscale:27
msgid ""
"Scale keypoints from pattern beginning with ``NP1`` to ``NP2`` (defaults to "
"``NP1`` ) in steps of ``NINC`` (defaults to 1). If ``NP1`` = ALL, ``NP2`` "
"and ``NINC`` are ignored and pattern is all selected keypoints ( :ref:`ksel`"
" ). If ``NP1`` = P, graphical picking is enabled and all remaining command "
"fields are ignored (valid only in the GUI). A component name may also be "
"substituted for ``NP1`` ( ``NP2`` and ``NINC`` are ignored)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/keypoints.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.keypoints.Keypoints.kscale:34
#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/keypoints.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.keypoints.Keypoints.kscale:39
#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/keypoints.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.keypoints.Keypoints.kscale:44
msgid ""
"Scale factor ratios. Scaling is relative to the origin of the active "
"coordinate system (RR, Rθ, RZ for cylindrical, RR, Rθ, RΦ for spherical). If"
" > 1.0, pattern is enlarged. If < 1.0, pattern is reduced. Ratios each "
"default to 1.0."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/keypoints.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.keypoints.Keypoints.kscale:62
msgid ""
"Generates a scaled pattern of keypoints from a given keypoint pattern. "
"Scaling is done in the active coordinate system (see analogous node scaling "
"( :ref:`nscale` )). Solid modeling in a toroidal coordinate system is not "
"recommended."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/doc/source/mapdl_commands/prep7/_autosummary/ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.keypoints.Keypoints.ksum.rst:2
msgid "ansys.mapdl.core.\\_commands.prep7.keypoints.Keypoints.ksum"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/doc/source/mapdl_commands/prep7/keypoints.rst:38:<autosummary>:1
#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/keypoints.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.keypoints.Keypoints.ksum:2
msgid "Calculates and prints geometry statistics of the selected keypoints."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/keypoints.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.keypoints.Keypoints.ksum:4
msgid ""
"Mechanical APDL Command: `KSUM "
"<https://ansyshelp.ansys.com/Views/Secured/corp/v232/en//ans_cmd/Hlp_C_KSUM.html>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/keypoints.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.keypoints.Keypoints.ksum:21
msgid ""
"Calculates and prints geometry statistics (centroid location, moments of "
"inertia, etc.) associated with the selected keypoints. Geometry items are "
"reported in the global Cartesian coordinate system. A unit density is "
"assumed, irrespective of any material associations ( :ref:`katt`, :ref:`mat`"
" ). Items calculated by :ref:`ksum` and later retrieved by a :ref:`get` or "
":ref:`starvget` command are valid only if the model is not modified after "
"the :ref:`ksum` command is issued."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/doc/source/mapdl_commands/prep7/_autosummary/ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.keypoints.Keypoints.ksymm.rst:2
msgid "ansys.mapdl.core.\\_commands.prep7.keypoints.Keypoints.ksymm"
msgstr ""

