" it by issuing <ans_cmd_cmdDef>` :ref:`mp`,EMIS. Otherwise, an error message"
" appears. If you issue :ref:`mp`,EMIS without specifying ``C0``, ``C1``, "
"``C2``, ``C3``, ``C4`` values, emissivity defaults to 0."
msgstr ""

