"Temperatures assigned to six locations starting with ``SLOC``. If a value is"
" already in this location, it will be redefined. A blank (or zero) value for"
" ``T1`` resets the previous value in ``SLOC`` to zero. A value of zero can "
"only be assigned by ``T1``. Blank (or zero) values for ``T2`` to ``T6`` "
"leave the corresponding previous values unchanged."
msgstr ""

