msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/meshing.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.meshing.Meshing.czdel:29
msgid ""
"The :ref:`czdel` command edits or deletes the interface elements and nodes, "
"along with the associated changes made to the underlying plane or solid "
"elements created during a previous :ref:`czmesh` operation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/meshing.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.meshing.Meshing.czdel:33
msgid ""
"Each :ref:`czmesh` operation will create groups of elements and nodes with "
"component names in the format CZME_EL01 (elements) and CZME_ND01 (nodes). "
"The final number of this format will be the number used for ``grp1`` and "
"``grp2``. If ``grp1`` = ALL, all nodes and elements created by the "
":ref:`czmesh` command will be deleted. After using :ref:`czdel`, all the "
"user-defined components will be unselected."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/meshing.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.meshing.Meshing.czdel:39
msgid "The :ref:`czdel` command is valid for structural analyses only."
msgstr ""

