"used for free meshing if SmartSizing is turned off ( :ref:`smrtsize`,OFF), "
"which is the default. Even when SmartSizing is on, some :ref:`desize` "
"settings (such as maximum and minimum element edge length) can affect free "
"mesh density. The default settings of the :ref:`desize` command are used "
"only when no other element size specifications ( :ref:`kesize`, "
":ref:`lesize`, :ref:`esize` ) exist for a certain line."
msgstr ""

