#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.meshing.Meshing.gsgdata:2
msgid ""
"Specifies the reference point and defines the geometry in the fiber "
"direction for the generalized plane strain element option."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/meshing.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.meshing.Meshing.gsgdata:5
