#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.meshing.Meshing.mshpattern:12
msgid ""
"``0`` - Allow Mechanical APDL choose the pattern (default). The program "
"maximizes the minimum angle of the triangular-shaped elements that are "
"created."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/meshing.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.meshing.Meshing.mshpattern:15
