"are used for refinement. If ``NN1`` = P, graphical picking is enabled and "
"all remaining command fields are ignored (valid only in the GUI). A "
"component name may also be substituted for ``NN1`` ( ``NN2`` and ``NINC`` "
"are ignored)."
