"specified by ``NUM``. New pretension nodes are associated with ``NUM`` or "
"entities below it. Any subsequent :ref:`lclear` operation of ``NUM`` deletes"
" the pretension elements and nodes created by :ref:`psmesh`. ( ``MPC184`` "
"joint elements and associated contact pairs of a preload section are not "
"deleted by :ref:`lclear`.)"
