"specified by ``NUM``. New pretension nodes are associated with ``NUM`` or "
"entities below it. Any subsequent :ref:`aclear` of ``NUM`` deletes the "
"pretension elements and nodes created by :ref:`psmesh`. ( ``MPC184`` joint "
"elements and associated contact pairs of a preload section are not deleted "
"by :ref:`aclear`.)"
msgstr ""

