#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/meshing.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.meshing.Meshing.smrtsize:9
msgid ""
"Overall element size level for meshing. The level value controls the "
"fineness of the mesh. (Any input in this field causes remaining arguments to"
" be ignored.) Valid inputs are:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/meshing.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.meshing.Meshing.smrtsize:12
msgid ""
"``n`` - Activate SmartSizing and set the size level to ``n``. Must be an "
"integer value from 1 (fine mesh) to 10 (coarse mesh). Remaining arguments "
"are ignored, and argument values are set as shown in :ref:`SMRTSIZE_tab_1`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/meshing.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.meshing.Meshing.smrtsize:16
msgid "``STAT`` - List current :ref:`smrtsize` settings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/meshing.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.meshing.Meshing.smrtsize:18
msgid ""
"``DEFA`` - Set all :ref:`smrtsize` settings to default values (as shown in "
":ref:`SMRTSIZE_tab_1` for size level 6)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/meshing.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.meshing.Meshing.smrtsize:21
msgid ""
"``OFF`` - Deactivate SmartSizing. Current settings of :ref:`desize` will be "
"used. To reactivate SmartSizing, issue :ref:`smrtsize`, ``n``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/meshing.pydocstring of
