msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/meshing.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.meshing.Meshing.smrtsize:81
msgid ""
"Surface proximity refinement key, can be off ( ``SPRX`` = 0, which is the "
"default for all levels ) or on via two different values ( ``SPRX`` = 1 or "
"``SPRX`` = 2). If ``SPRX`` = 1, surface proximity refinement is performed "
"and any shell elements that need to be modified are modified. If ``SPRX`` "
"=2, surface proximity refinement is performed but no shell elements are "
"altered."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/meshing.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.meshing.Meshing.smrtsize:100
