"Mechanical APDL Command: `DAMORPH "
"<https://ansyshelp.ansys.com/Views/Secured/corp/v232/en//ans_cmd/Hlp_C_DAMORPH.html>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/morphing.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.morphing.Morphing.damorph:9
msgid ""
"Non-structural area to which mesh movement (morph) applies. If ALL, apply "
"morphing to all selected areas [ASEL]. If ``AREA`` = P, graphical picking is"
" enabled. A component may be substituted for ``AREA``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/morphing.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.morphing.Morphing.damorph:13
msgid "**xline** : :class:`python:str`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/morphing.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.morphing.Morphing.damorph:14
msgid ""
"Lines to be excluded from morphing. If ALL, exclude all selected lines "
"[LSEL] from morphing. If ``XLINE`` = P, graphical picking is enabled. A "
"component may be substituted for ``XLINE``. If ``XLINE`` is blank (default),"
" allow morphing of nodes attached to lines of the selected areas ( ``AREA`` "
") which are not shared by unselected areas. See Notes for clarification."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/morphing.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.morphing.Morphing.damorph:19
#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/morphing.pydocstring of
