msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/morphing.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.morphing.Morphing.damorph:22
msgid ""
"``0`` - Remesh the selected non-structural areas only if mesh morphing "
"fails."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/morphing.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.morphing.Morphing.damorph:24
msgid ""
"``1`` - Remesh the selected non-structural areas and bypass mesh morphing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/morphing.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.morphing.Morphing.damorph:26
#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/morphing.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.morphing.Morphing.demorph:23
#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/morphing.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.morphing.Morphing.dvmorph:26
msgid "``2`` - Perform mesh morphing only and do not remesh."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/morphing.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.morphing.Morphing.damorph:42
msgid ""
"The selected areas should include only non-structural regions adjacent to "
"structural regions. :ref:`damorph` will morph the non-structural areas to "
"coincide with the deflections of the structural regions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/morphing.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.morphing.Morphing.damorph:46
msgid ""
"Nodes in the structural regions move in accordance with computed "
"displacements. Displacements from a structural analysis must be in the "
"database prior to issuing :ref:`damorph`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/morphing.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.morphing.Morphing.damorph:49
msgid ""
"By default, nodes attached to lines can move along the lines, or off the "
"lines (if a line is interior to the selected areas). You can use ``XLINE`` "
"to restrain nodes on certain lines."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/morphing.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.morphing.Morphing.damorph:52
msgid ""
"By default ( ``RMSHKEY`` = 0), :ref:`damorph` will remesh the selected non-"
"structural areas entirely if a satisfactory morphed mesh cannot be provided."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/morphing.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.morphing.Morphing.damorph:55
msgid ""
"If boundary conditions and loads are applied directly to nodes and elements,"
" the :ref:`damorph` command requires that these be removed before remeshing "
"can take place."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/morphing.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.morphing.Morphing.damorph:58
msgid ""
"Exercise care with initial conditions defined by the :ref:`ic` command. "
"Before a structural analysis is performed for a sequentially coupled "
"analysis, the :ref:`damorph` command requires that initial conditions be "
"removed from all null element type nodes in the non-structural regions. Use "
":ref:`icdele` to delete the initial conditions."
msgstr ""

