#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.morphing.Morphing.demorph:39
msgid ""
"The selected elements should include only non-structural regions adjacent to"
" structural regions. The exterior nodes of the selected elements will "
"usually be on the boundary of the region which will have node positions "
"displaced. For ``DIMN`` = 2, elements must lie on a flat plane. The "
":ref:`demorph` command requires a single domain grouping of elements be "
"provided (multiple domains of elements are not permitted). Exterior nodes "
"will be assumed fixed (no nodes will be morphed) unless they coincide with "
"structural nodes having nonzero displacements."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/morphing.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.morphing.Morphing.demorph:46
