#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.morphing.Morphing.morph:82
msgid ""
"Thermal ``PLANE35``, ``PLANE55``, ``PLANE77``, ``PLANE292``, ``PLANE293``, "
"``SOLID70``, ``SOLID87``, ``SOLID90``, ``SOLID278``, ``SOLID279``, and "
