msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/morphing.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.morphing.Morphing.morph:97
msgid ""
"After each remesh, new databases and results files are written with the "
"extensions :file:`.rth0n` and :file:`.db0n`, where ``n`` is the remesh file "
"number ( :file:`FieldName.rth01`, :file:`FieldName.rth02`,... and "
":file:`FieldName.db01`, :file:`FieldName.db02`, etc.). The original database"
" file is :file:`FieldName.dbo`. The :file:`FieldName.db01`, "
":file:`FieldName.db02`, etc. files have elements that are detached from the "
"solid model."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/morphing.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.morphing.Morphing.morph:103
msgid "Remeshing has the following restrictions:"
msgstr ""

