"and Z direction cosines. Existing rotation specifications on the node are "
"redefined. If only two of the three unit vectors are specified, the third is"
" defined according to the right hand rule. It is the responsibility of the "
"user to ensure that input direction cosines are orthogonal in a right-handed"
" system."
msgstr ""

