#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/nodes.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.nodes.Nodes.nlist:34
msgid ""
"``COORD`` - Suppress all but the XYZ coordinates (shown to a higher degree "
"of accuracy than when displayed with all information)."
msgstr ""

