#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.nodes.Nodes.nmodif:24
msgid ""
"Replace the previous coordinate values assigned to this node with these "
"corresponding coordinate values. Values are interpreted in the active "
"coordinate system (R, θ, Z for cylindrical; R, θ, Φ for spherical or "
"toroidal). Leaving any of these fields blank retains the previous value(s)."
msgstr ""

