"FLANGE, PSPRNG, and PGAP commands. Precede by \"-'' sign for negative "
"coordinates. (Example: 5+6+7/16 for 5 ft. 6-7/16 in., +3 for 3 in., -0+3 for"
" -3 in., +0+9/16 for 9/16 in.)."
msgstr ""

