" elements) are generated straight (in the active coordinate system). "
"Elements are of type PIPE16 straight pipes. Material properties, real "
"constants, and loads are derived from the previously defined piping "
"specifications. Piping loads and specifications are defined via PCORRO, "
"PDRAG, PFLUID, PINSUL, POPT, PPRES, PSPEC, PTEMP, and PUNIT commands."
msgstr ""

