"straight pipe elements. (See the RUN command description in `Archived "
"Commands "
"<https://ansyshelp.ansys.com/Views/Secured/corp/v232/en/ans_arch/Hlp_C_VALVE.html>`_.)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/piping.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.piping.Piping.tee:72
msgid ""
"The new tee is also composed of three PIPE16 straight pipe elements, but of "
"the leg lengths specified and with the appropriate tee factors calculated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/piping.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.piping.Piping.tee:75
msgid "Three new nodes are generated at the ends of the tee."
