#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/piping.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.piping.Piping.tee:77
msgid ""
"The original three straight pipes are automatically \"shortened\" to meet "
"the ends of the tee. The tee specifications and loadings are taken from the "
"corresponding three straight pipes."
msgstr ""

