"Radii of the bottom and top faces of the cone. A value of zero or blank for "
"either ``RBOT`` or ``RTOP`` defines a degenerate face at the center axis "
"(that is, the vertex of the cone). The same value for both ``RBOT`` and "
"``RTOP`` defines a cylinder instead of a cone."
msgstr ""

