msgid ""
"Inner and outer radii (either order) of the circle or cylinder. A value of "
"zero or blank for either ``RAD1`` or ``RAD2``, or the same value for both "
"``RAD1`` and ``RAD2``, defines a solid circle or cylinder."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/primitives.pydocstring
