#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.cycexpand:50
msgid ""
"``0 or OFF`` - Averages stresses or strains across sector boundaries. This "
"value is the default (although the default reverts to 1 or ON if the cyclic "
"count varies between active windows)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.cycexpand:53
msgid ""
"``1 or ON`` - No averaging of stresses or strains occurs, and sector "
"boundaries are shown on the plot. This setting is not valid for cyclic MSUP "
"harmonic analyses."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
