" modulus from nominal, :math:`equation not available`  (or equivalently, the"
" ratio of the frequency deviationsquared). Each frequency can also be "
"independently mistuned, in whichcase the array is NtimesM, where M is the "
"number of blade frequencies( ``Value3`` of :ref:`cycfreq`,BLADE). The "
"entries in each row therefore correspond to the ratio of the mistuned "
"frequency to the tuned frequency squared minus one:"
