"The description of the argument is missing in the Python function. Please, "
"refer to the `command documentation "
"<https://ansyshelp.ansys.com/Views/Secured/corp/v232/en//ans_cmd/Hlp_C_MSOPT.html>`_"
" for further information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.msopt:137
msgid ""
"The :ref:`msopt` command is used to specify solution options for a "
"`multistage cyclic symmetry analysis "
"<https://ansyshelp.ansys.com/Views/Secured/corp/v232/en/ans_mstag/ans_mstag_introTheory.html>`_."
" It is not part of the :ref:`cyclic` procedure for a cyclic symmetry "
"analysis."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.msopt:142
msgid ""
"When you issue :ref:`msopt`,EXPAND, subsequent :ref:`set` commands read the "
"data set from the specified :file:`.rst` file and expand the nodes and "
"elements to the stages and sectors specified via :ref:`msopt`,EXPAND."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/doc/source/mapdl_commands/prep7/_autosummary/ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.mstole.rst:2
msgid "ansys.mapdl.core.\\_commands.prep7.special\\_purpose.SpecialPurpose.mstole"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/doc/source/mapdl_commands/prep7/special_purpose.rst:35:<autosummary>:1
#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.mstole:2
msgid ""
"Adds two extra nodes from ``FLUID116`` elements to ``SURF151`` or "
"``SURF152`` elements for convection analyses."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.mstole:5
msgid ""
"Mechanical APDL Command: `MSTOLE "
"<https://ansyshelp.ansys.com/Views/Secured/corp/v232/en//ans_cmd/Hlp_C_MSTOLE.html>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.mstole:9
msgid "**method** : :class:`python:int` or :class:`python:str`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.mstole:10
msgid "Mapping method:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.mstole:12
msgid "``0`` - Hybrid method (default)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.mstole:14
msgid "``1`` - Projection method."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.mstole:16
msgid "``2`` - Minimum centroid distance method."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.mstole:18
msgid "**namesurf** : :class:`python:str`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.mstole:19
msgid ""
"Component name for a group of ``SURF151`` or ``SURF152`` elements. The "
"component name must be 32 characters or less, and it must be enclosed in "
"single quotes (for example, 'COM152') when the :ref:`mstole` command is "
"manually typed in."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.mstole:23
msgid "**namefluid** : :class:`python:str`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.mstole:24
msgid ""
"Component name for a group of ``FLUID116`` elements. The component name must"
" be 32 characters or less, and it must be enclosed in single quotes (for "
"example, 'COM116') when the :ref:`mstole` command is manually typed in."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.mstole:42
msgid ""
"For convection analyses, the :ref:`mstole` command adds two extra nodes from"
" ``FLUID116`` elements to ``SURF151`` or ``SURF152`` elements by employing "
"the specified mapping method. In the hybrid method, the projection method is"
" tried first and if it fails the centroid distance method is used. The "
"``SURF151`` or ``SURF152`` elements and the ``FLUID116`` elements must be "
"grouped into components and named using the :ref:`cm` command."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.mstole:48
msgid ""
"The ``SURF151`` or ``SURF152`` extra node option must be set for two extra "
"nodes (KEYOPT(5) = 2)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.mstole:50
msgid ""
"For more information, see `Using the Surface Effect Elements "
"<https://ansyshelp.ansys.com/Views/Secured/corp/v232/en/ans_the/Hlp_G_THE2_5.html#>`_"
" in the `Thermal Analysis Guide "
"<https://ansyshelp.ansys.com/Views/Secured/corp/v232/en/ans_the/Hlp_G_THE4.html>`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/doc/source/mapdl_commands/prep7/_autosummary/ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.perbc2d.rst:2
msgid ""
"ansys.mapdl.core.\\_commands.prep7.special\\_purpose.SpecialPurpose.perbc2d"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/doc/source/mapdl_commands/prep7/special_purpose.rst:35:<autosummary>:1
#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.perbc2d:2
msgid "Generates periodic constraints for 2D planar magnetic field analyses."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.perbc2d:4
msgid ""
"Mechanical APDL Command: `PERBC2D "
"<https://ansyshelp.ansys.com/Views/Secured/corp/v232/en//ans_cmd/Hlp_C_PERBC2D.html>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.perbc2d:8
msgid "**loc1** : :class:`python:str`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.perbc2d:9
msgid ""
"Constant coordinate location of the first plane of nodes. For ``PLNOPT`` = 1"
" or 2, the constant coordinate location is the global Cartesian coordinate "
"system ( :ref:`csys`,0) location in the X or Y direction respectively. For "
"``PLNOPT`` = 0, the location is the angle in the global cylindrical "
"coordinate system ( :ref:`csys`,1)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.perbc2d:14
msgid "**loc2** : :class:`python:str`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.perbc2d:15
msgid ""
"Constant coordinate location of the second plane of nodes. For ``PLNOPT`` = "
"1 or 2, the constant coordinate location is the global Cartesian coordinate "
"system ( :ref:`csys`,0) location in the X or Y direction respectively. For "
"``PLNOPT`` = 0, the location is the angle (in degrees) in the global "
"cylindrical coordinate system ( :ref:`csys`,1)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.perbc2d:20
msgid "**loctol** : :class:`python:str`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.perbc2d:21
msgid ""
"Tolerance on the constant coordinate location for node selection. Defaults "
"to.00001 for ``PLNOPT`` = 1 or 2 and.001 degrees for ``PLNOPT`` = 0."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.perbc2d:25
msgid ""
"Minimum coordinate location along the second plane of nodes. For ``PLNOPT`` "
"= 1 or 2, the coordinate location is the global Cartesian coordinate system "
"location in the Y or X direction respectively. For ``PLNOPT`` = 0, the "
"coordinate location is the radial coordinate value in the global cylindrical"
" coordinate system. Periodic conditions are not applied to nodes at this "
"location."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.perbc2d:32
msgid ""
"Maximum coordinate location along the second plane of nodes. For ``PLNOPT`` "
"= 1 or 2, the coordinate location is the global Cartesian coordinate system "
"location in the Y or X direction respectively. For ``PLNOPT`` = 0, the "
"coordinate location is the radial coordinate value in the global cylindrical"
" coordinate system. Periodic conditions are not applied to nodes at this "
"location."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.perbc2d:38
msgid "**tolr** : :class:`python:str`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.perbc2d:39
msgid ""
"Tolerance dimension on node selection along the plane of nodes. Defaults "
"to.00001."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.perbc2d:42
msgid "Periodic option:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.perbc2d:44
msgid ""
"``0`` - Odd symmetry (default). Apply constraint equations such that AZ(i) ="
" -AZ(j)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.perbc2d:46
msgid "``1`` - Even symmetry. Apply node coupling such that AZ(i) = AZ(j)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.perbc2d:48
msgid "**plnopt** : :class:`python:int` or :class:`python:str`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.perbc2d:49
msgid "Symmetry plane option:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.perbc2d:51
msgid ""
"``0`` - Planes of constant angle in the global cylindrical coordinate system"
" ( :ref:`csys`,1)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.perbc2d:53
msgid ""
"``1`` - Planes parallel to the global Cartesian X axis ( :ref:`csys`,0)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.perbc2d:55
msgid ""
"``2`` - Planes parallel to the global Cartesian Y axis ( :ref:`csys`,0)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.perbc2d:71
msgid ""
":ref:`perbc2d` invokes a Mechanical APDL macro which generates periodic "
"boundary condition constraints for 2D planar magnetic field analysis."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.perbc2d:75
msgid ""
"The macro is restricted to node pairs sharing common coordinate values along"
" symmetry planes separated by a constant coordinate value. Planes (or lines)"
" must lie at either constant angles ( ``PLNOPT`` = 0), constant X values ( "
"``PLNOPT`` = 1), or constant Y values ( ``PLNOPT`` = 2)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.perbc2d:79
msgid ""
"The macro applies constraint equations ( ``OPT`` = 0, odd symmetry) or node "
"coupling ( ``OPT`` = 1, even symmetry) to each node pair sharing a common "
"coordinate value along the symmetry planes. By default, periodic conditions "
"are not applied at the first and last node pairs on the symmetry planes "
"unless the input location values, R1 and R2, are adjusted to be less than or"
" greater than the actual node coordinate values."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/special_purpose.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.perbc2d:85
msgid ""
"Nodes are selected for application of constraints via :ref:`nsel`, with "
"tolerances on the constant coordinate location ( ``LOCTOL`` ) and the "
"coordinate location along the plane (RTOL)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/doc/source/mapdl_commands/prep7/_autosummary/ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.special_purpose.SpecialPurpose.race.rst:2
