"Tolerance used to determine if use pass nodes are noncoincident with master "
"nodes having the same node numbers. Defaults to 0.0001. Use pass nodes will "
"always be replaced by master nodes of the same node number. However, if a "
"use pass node is more than ``TOLER`` away from the corresponding master "
"node, a warning is generated."
msgstr ""

