"The name (case-sensitive) of the superelement matrix file created by the "
"substructure generation pass ( :file:`Sename.SUB` ). Defaults to the current"
" :file:`Jobname`. If a number, it is the element number of a previously "
"defined superelement in the current use pass."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/superelements.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.superelements.Superelements.sesymm:23
msgid "Increment all nodes in the superelement by ``INC``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/superelements.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.superelements.Superelements.sesymm:26
msgid ""
"File name and directory path (248 characters maximum, including the "
"characters needed for the directory path). An unspecified directory path "
"defaults to the working directory; in this case, you can use all 248 "
"characters for the file name. This field must be input."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/superelements.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.superelements.Superelements.sesymm:31
#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/superelements.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.superelements.Superelements.setran:28
msgid ""
"Filename extension (eight-character maximum). The extension defaults to SUB."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/superelements.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.superelements.Superelements.sesymm:47
msgid ""
"Performs a symmetry operation on a superelement within the substructure use "
"pass by reversing the sign of component ``Ncomp`` in the global Cartesian "
"coordinate system. The node numbers are incremented by ``INC``. The new "
"superelement is written to :file:`File.SUB` in the current directory (by "
"default). All master node nodal coordinate systems must be global Cartesian "
"(no rotated nodes allowed)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/superelements.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.superelements.Superelements.sesymm:53
msgid ""
"The maximum number of transformations for a given superelement is five "
"(including :ref:`setran`, :ref:`sesymm`, and the large rotation "
"transformation if :ref:`nlgeom` is ON in the use pass)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/superelements.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.superelements.Superelements.sesymm:56
#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/superelements.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.superelements.Superelements.setran:93
msgid ""
"This command is not supported if the original superelement matrix was "
"created in a component mode synthesis analysis generation pass with the "
"element results calculation activated ( ``Elcalc`` = YES on :ref:`cmsopt` )."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/doc/source/mapdl_commands/prep7/_autosummary/ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.superelements.Superelements.setran.rst:2
