#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/volumes.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.volumes.Volumes.extopt:11
msgid ""
"``ON`` - Sets carryover of the material attributes, real constant "
"attributes, and element coordinate system attributes of the pattern area "
"elements to the generated volume elements. Sets the pattern area mesh to "
"clear when volume generations are done. ``Val1``, ``Val2``, and ``Val3`` are"
" ignored."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/volumes.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.volumes.Volumes.extopt:16
msgid ""
"``OFF`` - Removes all settings associated with this command. ``Val1``, "
"``Val2``, and ``Val3`` are ignored."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/volumes.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.volumes.Volumes.extopt:19
msgid ""
"``STAT`` - Shows all settings associated with this command. ``Val1``, "
"``Val2``, ``Val3``, and ``Val4`` are ignored."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/prep7/volumes.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.prep7.volumes.Volumes.extopt:22
msgid ""
"``ATTR`` - Sets carryover of particular pattern area attributes (materials, "
"real constants, and element coordinate systems) of the pattern area elements"
" to the generated volume elements. (See :ref:`EXTOPT_notes_2`.) ``Val1`` can"
" be:"
