msgid ""
"Defines a volume (and its corresponding lines and areas) through eight (or "
"fewer) existing keypoints. Keypoints must be input in a continuous order. "
"The order of the keypoints should be around the bottom and then the top. "
"Missing lines are generated \"straight\" in the active coordinate system and"
" assigned the lowest available numbers ( :ref:`numstr` ). Missing areas are "
"generated and assigned the lowest available numbers."
msgstr ""

