"For example, use :ref:`v`, ``P1``, ``P2``, ``P3``, ``P3``, ``P5``, ``P6``, "
"``P7``, ``P7`` for a triangular prism or :ref:`v`, ``P1``, ``P2``, ``P3``, "
"``P3``, ``P5``, ``P5``, ``P5``, ``P5`` for a tetrahedron."
