"``SPARSE`` - Use a sparsification scheme for file compression (default)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/session/files.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.session.files.Files.fcomp:25
msgid "``0`` - No file compression occurs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/session/files.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.session.files.Files.fcomp:27
msgid ""
"``n`` - A zlib-based file compression occurs using level number ``n``, which"
" ranges from 1 to 5."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/session/files.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.session.files.Files.fcomp:43
msgid ""
"Specifies file compression options for results files ( :file:`.rst`, "
":file:`.rstp`, :file:`.rth`, and :file:`.rmg` files), database files ( "
":file:`.db` and :file:`.rdb` ), certain restart files ( :file:`.Rnnn` ), and"
" the :file:`.osav` file created during a nonlinear analysis. (See `Program- "
"Generated Files "
"<https://ansyshelp.ansys.com/Views/Secured/corp/v232/en/ans_bas/Hlp_G_BAS18_4.html#aHXtsq2aaldm>`_"
" :ref:`set` command or the :ref:`resume` command)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/session/files.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.session.files.Files.fcomp:50
msgid ""
"For results files compressed using the sparsification scheme ( ``LEVEL`` = "
"SPARSE, which is the default), use the ``*XPL`` command to uncompress the "
"file. For third party tools that need to read the results file, use the "
"method described in `Accessing Mechanical APDL Binary Files "
"<https://ansyshelp.ansys.com/Views/Secured/corp/v232/en/ans_prog/Hlp_P_INT2_1.html#intlargeintget>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/session/files.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.session.files.Files.fcomp:55
msgid ""
"See in the `Basic Analysis Guide "
"<https://ansyshelp.ansys.com/Views/Secured/corp/v232/en/ans_bas/Hlp_G_BAS19.html>`_"
" for more details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/doc/source/mapdl_commands/session/_autosummary/ansys.mapdl.core._commands.session.files.Files.lgwrite.rst:2
