"File name and directory path to which the log file is to be copied (248 "
"characters maximum, including directory). If you do not specify a directory "
"path, it will default to your working directory and you can use all 248 "
"characters for the file name."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/doc/source/mapdl_commands/session/_autosummary/ansys.mapdl.core._commands.session.files.Files.slashdelete.rst:2
msgid "ansys.mapdl.core.\\_commands.session.files.Files.slashdelete"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/doc/source/mapdl_commands/session/files.rst:30:<autosummary>:1
#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/session/files.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.session.files.Files.slashdelete:2
msgid "Deletes a file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/session/files.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.session.files.Files.slashdelete:4
msgid ""
"Mechanical APDL Command: `/DELETE "
"<https://ansyshelp.ansys.com/Views/Secured/corp/v232/en//ans_cmd/Hlp_C_DELETE_sl.html>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/session/files.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.session.files.Files.slashdelete:9
msgid ""
"File name and directory path (248 characters maximum, including the "
"characters needed for the directory path). An unspecified directory path "
"defaults to the working directory; in this case, you can use all 248 "
"characters for the file name. The file name defaults to the current "
":file:`Jobname`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/session/files.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.session.files.Files.slashdelete:18
msgid ""
"Key that specifies which file deletion action is performed on all processes "
"in distributed-memory parallel mode:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/session/files.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.session.files.Files.slashdelete:21
msgid ""
"``0 (OFF or NO)`` - The program performs the file deletion only on the "
"master process (default)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/session/files.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.session.files.Files.slashdelete:23
msgid ""
"``1 (ON or YES)`` - The program performs the file deletion locally on each "
"process."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/session/files.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.session.files.Files.slashdelete:25
msgid ""
"``2 or BOTH`` - The program performs file deletion for ``Fname``. ``Ext`` on"
" the master process and for ``FnameN``. ``Ext`` on all processes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/session/files.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.session.files.Files.slashdelete:40
msgid ""
"In distributed-memory parallel (DMP) mode, only the master process will "
"delete ``Fname``. ``Ext`` by default. However, when ``DistKey`` is set to 1 "
"(or ON, or YES) or 2 (or BOTH), the command is executed by all processes. In"
" this case, ``Fname`` will automatically have the process rank appended to "
"it. This means ``FnameN``. ``Ext`` will be deleted by all processes, where "
"``N`` is the DMP process rank. For more information see in the `Parallel "
"Processing Guide "
"<https://ansyshelp.ansys.com/Views/Secured/corp/v232/en/ans_dan/HybParallel.html>`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/doc/source/mapdl_commands/session/_autosummary/ansys.mapdl.core._commands.session.files.Files.slashfdele.rst:2
msgid "ansys.mapdl.core.\\_commands.session.files.Files.slashfdele"
msgstr ""

