#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/session/files.pydocstring of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.session.files.Files.slashfdele:19
msgid "``DELE`` - Delete (or do not write, if not necessary) this file."
