"(GUI) is active. The GUI sometimes issues \"hidden\" :ref:`nopr` and "
":ref:`gopr` command sequences, which will countermand user-issued "
":ref:`nopr` commands, thus making the use of :ref:`nopr` in the GUI "
"environment unpredictable."
msgstr ""

