#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/session/run_controls.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.session.run_controls.RunControls.uis:11
msgid ""
"``BORD`` - Controls the functionality of the mouse buttons for dynamic "
"viewing mode only. When ``Label`` = BORD, the three values that follow "
"control the functionality of the LEFT, MIDDLE and RIGHT buttons, "
"respectively (see below)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/session/run_controls.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.session.run_controls.RunControls.uis:15
msgid ""
"``MSGPOP`` - Controls which messages from the Mechanical APDL error-message "
"subroutine are displayed in a message dialog box."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/session/run_controls.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.session.run_controls.RunControls.uis:18
msgid ""
"``REPLOT`` - Controls whether or not an automatic replot occurs after "
"functions affecting the model are executed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/session/run_controls.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.session.run_controls.RunControls.uis:21
msgid ""
"``ABORT`` - Controls whether or not the program displays dialog boxes to "
"show the status of an operation in progress and to cancel that operation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/session/run_controls.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.session.run_controls.RunControls.uis:24
msgid ""
"``DYNA`` - Controls whether the dynamic mode preview is a bounding box or "
"the edge outline of the model. This label only applies to 2D display devices"
" (that is, :ref:`show`,XII or :ref:`show`,WIN32). This \"model edge "
"outline\" mode is only supported in PowerGraphics ( :ref:`graphics`,POWER) "
"and is intended for element, line, results, area, or volume displays."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/session/run_controls.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.session.run_controls.RunControls.uis:29
msgid ""
"``PICK`` - Controls how graphical entities are highlighted from within the "
"the Select menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/session/run_controls.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.session.run_controls.RunControls.uis:31
msgid ""
"``POWER`` - Controls whether or not PowerGraphics is active when the GUI is "
"initiated. Mechanical APDL default status is PowerGraphics \"ON\"; this "
"command is used (placed in the :file:`start.ans` file) when full graphics is"
" desired on start up."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/session/run_controls.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.session.run_controls.RunControls.uis:35
msgid ""
