#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/_nonlinear_options.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution._nonlinear_options.NonlinearOptions.crplim:35
msgid ""
"The creep ratio control can be used at the same time for implicit creep and "
"explicit creep analyses. For implicit creep ( ``Option`` = 1), the default "
