"or Linux ) for a list of supported GPU hardware. Use of this capability also"
" requires HPC licensing. For more information, see `GPU Accelerator "
"Capability "
"<https://ansyshelp.ansys.com/Views/Secured/corp/v232/en/ans_dan/gputrouble.html>`_"
