#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.analysis_options.AnalysisOptions.monitor:84
msgid ""
"``TOTAL TIME/LFACT`` - Total time (or load factor) for the last successful "
"attempt in the current substep."
msgstr ""

