#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.analysis_options.AnalysisOptions.monitor:87
msgid ""
"``VARIAB 1`` - Variable field 1. By default, this field lists the elapsed "
"(or wall clock) times used up to (but not including) the current substep."
