#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/analysis_options.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.analysis_options.AnalysisOptions.monitor:90
msgid ""
"``VARIAB 2`` - Variable field 2. In this example, the field is reporting the"
" MZ value. By default, this field lists the maximum displacement in the "
"entire structure."
