" :ref:`antype`,MODAL) analysis. Applies only to the mode-superposition "
"transient analysis ( :ref:`antype`,TRANS), mode- superposition harmonic "
"analysis ( :ref:`antype`,HARMIC), random vibration analysis ( :ref:`antype` "
