"amounts of energy dissipation, such as elastic-plastic material, ``TOLERB`` "
"can be larger. If the analysis includes contact or rapidly varying loads, a "
"smaller value of ``TOLERB`` should be used if high frequency response is "
"important; otherwise, a larger value of ``TOLERB`` may be used to enable "
