"For ``ModeSelMethod`` = MODC on the :ref:`mxpand` command, ``dir1`` "
"corresponds to the first input spectrum, ``dir2`` to the second, etc. (i.e. "
"for multiple spectrum inputs; the actual directions correspond to their "
"respective SED directions). If ``dir1`` =YES, then any mode in this spectrum"
" is expanded if its mode coefficient divided by the largest mode coefficient"
" is greater than SIGNIF on the :ref:`mxpand` command. If ``dir1`` =NO, then "
"the specified direction is not considered as a criterion for expansion."
msgstr ""

