#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.dynamic_options.DynamicOptions.mxpand:68
msgid "**modeselmethod** : :class:`python:str`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/dynamic_options.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.dynamic_options.DynamicOptions.mxpand:69
msgid "Methods for mode selection (not supported for complex eigensolvers):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/dynamic_options.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.dynamic_options.DynamicOptions.mxpand:71
msgid "```` - No mode selection is performed (default)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/dynamic_options.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.dynamic_options.DynamicOptions.mxpand:73
msgid "``EFFM`` - The mode selection is based on the modal effective masses."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/dynamic_options.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.dynamic_options.DynamicOptions.mxpand:75
msgid "``MODC`` - The mode selection is based on the mode coefficients."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/dynamic_options.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.dynamic_options.DynamicOptions.mxpand:77
msgid ""
"``DDAM`` - The mode selection is based on DDAM procedure (see `Mode "
"Selection Based on the DDAM Method "
"<https://ansyshelp.ansys.com/Views/Secured/corp/v232/en/ans_str/Hlp_G_STR_SMSUP.html#>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/dynamic_options.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.dynamic_options.DynamicOptions.mxpand:85
msgid ""
"``YES`` - Calculate average, amplitude, and peak values for the following: "
"stiffness and kinetic energies, and damping energy."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/dynamic_options.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.dynamic_options.DynamicOptions.mxpand:102
msgid ""
"Specifies the number of modes to expand and write over a frequency range for"
" a modal ( :ref:`antype` ,MODAL) or buckling ( :ref:`antype`,BUCKLE) "
"analysis. If used in SOLUTION, this command is valid only within the first "
"load step."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/dynamic_options.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.dynamic_options.DynamicOptions.mxpand:106
msgid ""
"There is no limit on the number of expanded modes ( ``NMODE`` ). However, "
"there is a limit on the maximum number of modes used via the :ref:`get`, "
"MODE command, mode combinations, and the :ref:`mdamp` command."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/dynamic_options.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.dynamic_options.DynamicOptions.mxpand:110
msgid ""
"With ``MSUPkey`` = YES, the computed element results ( ``Elcalc`` = YES) are"
" written to :file:`Jobname.mode` for use in subsequent downstream mode-"
"superposition analyses, including harmonic, transient, and all spectrum "
"analyses. This significantly reduces computation time for the combination or"
" expansion passes. For limitations and available elemental results, see."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/dynamic_options.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.dynamic_options.DynamicOptions.mxpand:115
msgid ""
"The calculation of additional energies ( ``EngCalc`` = YES) is valid only "
"for ``Method`` = DAMP on the :ref:`modopt` command and ``Method`` = QRDAMP "
"with ``Cpxmod`` = CPLX on the :ref:`modopt` command."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/dynamic_options.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.dynamic_options.DynamicOptions.mxpand:119
msgid ""
"If a mode selection method ( ``ModeSelMethod`` ) is defined, only the "
"selected modes will be expanded. See `Using Mode Selection "
"<https://ansyshelp.ansys.com/Views/Secured/corp/v232/en/ans_str/Hlp_G_STR_SMSUP.html#strModSelBasDD>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/dynamic_options.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.dynamic_options.DynamicOptions.mxpand:123
msgid ""
"For array input ( ``NMODE`` ), the array must be dimensioned to be the size "
"of the number of modes extracted ( ``NMODE`` on the :ref:`modopt` command). "
"A value of 1 in the array indicates the mode is to be expanded, and a value "
"of 0 indicates not to expand the mode. For the DAMP modal solution, the "
"modes are in pairs, so be sure to verify that both modes of a pair have the "
"same value. (For example, if modes #3 and #4 are a pair, indices 3 and 4 in "
"the array should have the same value, 0 or 1.)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/dynamic_options.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.dynamic_options.DynamicOptions.mxpand:130
msgid ""
"For `linear perturbation "
"<https://ansyshelp.ansys.com/Views/Secured/corp/v232/en/ans_str/strlinpertother.html>`_"
" modal analyses, you must set both ``Elcalc`` and ``MSUPkey`` to YES so that"
" the downstream stress expansion pass can produce a solution consistent with"
" the linear or nonlinear base (static or full transient) analysis. The "
"prestressed nonlinear element history (saved variables) is accessible only "
"in the first and second phases of the linear perturbation. The downstream "
"mode superposition analysis (such as MSUP or PSD) can only reuse the "
"nonlinear information contained in the :file:`Jobname.mode` file that is "
"generated in the linear perturbation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/dynamic_options.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.dynamic_options.DynamicOptions.mxpand:139
msgid ""
"In a distributed-memory parallel (DMP) analysis, you must issue "
":ref:`mxpand` to specify the number of modes to expand when computing the "
"modes and mode shapes. In a DMP run, :ref:`mxpand` cannot be issued in an "
"expansion pass ( :ref:`expass` )."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/doc/source/mapdl_commands/solution/_autosummary/ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.dynamic_options.DynamicOptions.qrdopt.rst:2
msgid ""
"ansys.mapdl.core.\\_commands.solution.dynamic\\_options.DynamicOptions.qrdopt"
msgstr ""

