msgid "Deletes nodal body-force loads."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/fe_body_loads.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.fe_body_loads.FeBodyLoads.bfdele:4
msgid ""
"Mechanical APDL Command: `BFDELE "
"<https://ansyshelp.ansys.com/Views/Secured/corp/v232/en//ans_cmd/Hlp_C_BFDELE.html>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/fe_body_loads.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.fe_body_loads.FeBodyLoads.bfdele:9
msgid ""
"Node at which body load is to be deleted. If ALL, delete for all selected "
"nodes ( :ref:`nsel` ). If ``Node`` = P, graphical picking is enabled and all"
" remaining command fields are ignored (valid only in the GUI). You can "
"substitute a component name for ``Node``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/fe_body_loads.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.fe_body_loads.FeBodyLoads.bfdele:14
msgid ""
"Valid body load label. If ALL, use all appropriate labels. See :ref:`bf`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/fe_body_loads.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.fe_body_loads.FeBodyLoads.bfdele:30
msgid ""
"Deletes nodal body-force loads for a specified node and label. Nodal body "
"loads are defined via :ref:`bf`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/doc/source/mapdl_commands/solution/_autosummary/ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.fe_body_loads.FeBodyLoads.bfe.rst:2
