"Because :ref:`tunif` (or :ref:`bfunif`,TEMP) is step-applied in the first "
"iteration, issue a :ref:`bf`,ALL,TEMP, ``Value`` command to ramp on a "
"uniform temperature load."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/fe_body_loads.pydocstring
