#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/fe_body_loads.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.fe_body_loads.FeBodyLoads.tunif:47
msgid ""
"If using the command default to set the uniform temperature (to the "
"reference temperature set via :ref:`tref` ), you can convert temperature-"
"dependent secant coefficients of thermal expansion (SCTEs) from the "
"definition temperature to the uniform temperature. To do so, issue the "
":ref:`mpamod` command."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/doc/source/mapdl_commands/solution/_autosummary/ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.fe_constraints.FeConstraints.d.rst:2
