"are ignored and constraints for all selected nodes ( :ref:`nsel` ) are "
"deleted. If ``NODE`` = P, graphical picking is enabled and all remaining "
"command fields are ignored (valid only in the GUI). A component name may "
"also be substituted for ``NODE``."
msgstr ""

