"for the following labels: Fluid (FLOW), Electric (AMPS), Structural force "
"(FX, FY, FZ, MX, MY, MZ), Thermal (HEAT, HBOT, HE2, HE3,..., HTOP), "
"Diffusion (RATE). Tabular boundary conditions are valid only in static ( "
":ref:`antype`,STATIC), full transient ( :ref:`antype`,TRANS), full harmonic "
"( :ref:`antype`, HARMIC), modal superposition harmonic and modal "
"superposition transient analyses."
msgstr ""

