"``X`` - Slope is along X direction (default). Interpreted as R direction for"
" non-Cartesian coordinate systems."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/fe_surface_loads.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.fe_surface_loads.FeSurfaceLoads.sfgrad:28
