" ``TABNAME_Y``, and ``TABNAME_Z``) for ``ACEL_X``, ``ACEL_Y``, and "
"``ACEL_Z`` input values ( :ref:`dim` ) as a function of both time and "
"frequency for full transient and harmonic analyses."
