"``OMEGAY``, and ``OMEGAZ``  input values ( :ref:`dim` ) for modal, full "
"transient, and full harmonic analyses. In this case, if the end point is "
"specified ( ``X2``, ``Y2``, ``Z2`` ), the rotational velocity axis must be "
"along the global X-, Y-, or Z-axis."
msgstr ""

