"highest number read in the current session. Issue :ref:`lsread`,STAT to list"
" the current value of ``LSNUM``. Issue :ref:`lsread`,INIT to reset ``LSNUM``"
" to 1. The load step files are assumed to be named :file:`Jobname.Sn`, where"
" ``n`` is a number assigned by the :ref:`lswrite` command (01-- 09,10,11, "
"etc.). On systems with a 3-character limit on the extension, the S is "
"dropped for ``LSNUM`` > 99."
msgstr ""

