msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/load_step_options.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.load_step_options.LoadStepOptions.deltim:9
msgid ""
"Time step size for this step. If automatic time stepping is used ( "
":ref:`autots` ), ``DTIME`` is the starting time substep."
