#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/load_step_options.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.load_step_options.LoadStepOptions.deltim:12
msgid ""
"If contact elements ( ``TARGE169``, ``TARGE170``, ``CONTA172``, "
"``CONTA174``, ``CONTA175``, or ``CONTA177`` ) are used, defaults to ``TIME``"
" or ``TIME`` /20 (where ``TIME`` is the time at the end of the load step as "
"set on the :ref:`time` command), depending on the physics of the model. If "
"none of these contact elements are used, defaults to ``TIME``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/load_step_options.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.load_step_options.LoadStepOptions.deltim:17
