"The routines are commented and should be listed after performing a custom "
"installation from the distribution media for more details. See also the "
"`Advanced Analysis Guide "
"<https://ansyshelp.ansys.com/Views/Secured/corp/v232/en/ans_adv/advoceanloading.html>`_"
" for a general description of user- programmable features."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/load_step_options.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.load_step_options.LoadStepOptions.usrcal:422
msgid ""
"You must have system permission, system access, and knowledge to write, "
"compile, and link the appropriate subroutines into the program at your site."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/load_step_options.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.load_step_options.LoadStepOptions.usrcal:425
