#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/load_step_options.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.load_step_options.LoadStepOptions.usrcal:434
msgid ""
"Because a user-programmed subroutine is a nonstandard use of the program, "
"the verification of any Mechanical APDL run incorporating these commands is "
"entirely your responsibility. In any contact with customer support regarding"
" the performance of a custom version of Mechanical APDL, explicitly state "
"that a user-programmable feature has been used."
