#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.misc_loads.MiscLoads.anpres:19
msgid "Reference frame for the model rotation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/misc_loads.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.misc_loads.MiscLoads.anpres:21
msgid ""
"``0`` - Rotating reference frame (default). The model remains fixed in space"
" and the pressure revolve around the model."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/misc_loads.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.misc_loads.MiscLoads.anpres:24
msgid ""
"``1`` - Stationary reference frame. The model rotates and the pressure "
"locations remain fixed in space."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/misc_loads.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.misc_loads.MiscLoads.anpres:41
msgid ""
":ref:`anpres` invokes a macro which produces an animated sequence of the "
"time-harmonic applied pressure in the case of a mode-superposition harmonic "
"analysis ( :ref:`antype`,HARMIC with :ref:`cycopt`,MSUP,ON). The engine-"
"order excitation must also have been specified ( :ref:`cycfreq`,EO). While "
"pressure loads are not accepted as valid loading in a mode-superposition "
"analysis (they must be applied in the modal analysis and the modal load "
"vector applied in the mode- superposition analysis) you can apply them for "
"the purposes of this animation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/misc_loads.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.misc_loads.MiscLoads.anpres:48
msgid ""
"For ``RefFrame`` = 1 (stationary reference frame), the rotational velocity "
"from the Linear Perturbation step, or the current :ref:`omega` or "
":ref:`cgomga` value, is used to determine the rotation direction about the "
"cyclic cylindrical axis, otherwise a positive rotation is assumed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/misc_loads.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.misc_loads.MiscLoads.anpres:52
msgid ""
"You may use :ref:`hbc`,,ON to hide overlapping pressure faces, and use "
":ref:`gline`,,-1 to suppress the element outlines if desired."
msgstr ""

