"element. A component name is not allowed with the BASIC, RSFO, or ALL "
"labels."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/misc_loads.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.misc_loads.MiscLoads.outpr:72
msgid ""
"Controls the solution items to be printed, the frequency with which they are"
" printed (in static, transient, or full harmonic analyses), and the set of "
"nodes or elements to which this specification applies (in static, transient,"
" or full harmonic analyses). An item is associated with either a node ( "
":ref:`nsol`, :ref:`rforce`, V, and A items) or an element (all of the "
"remaining items). The specifications are processed in the order that they "
"are input. Use :ref:`outpr`,STAT to list the current specifications and use "
":ref:`outpr`,ERASE to erase all the current specifications."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/misc_loads.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.misc_loads.MiscLoads.outpr:79
msgid ""
