"analysis type) for all elements. To restrict the solution printout, use "
":ref:`outpr` to selectively suppress ( ``Freq`` = NONE) the writing of "
"solution data, or first suppress the writing of all solution data ( "
":ref:`outpr`,ALL,NONE) and then selectively turn on the writing of solution "
"data with subsequent :ref:`outpr` commands."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/misc_loads.pydocstring
#: of ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.misc_loads.MiscLoads.outpr:88
