"issued, the change of fiber length at the ending point during deformation "
"and the rotation of the ending plane about X and Y during deformation will "
"be printed if any displacement at the nodes is printed. The reaction forces "
"at the ending point will be printed if any reaction force at the nodes is "
"printed."
