"1.0 for temperature (TEMP) when the iterative QUASI solver is used ( "
":ref:`thopt`,QUASI,,,,,,1)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/nonlinear_options.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.nonlinear_options.NonlinearOptions.cnvtol:66
msgid ""
"If you choose to specify a ``TOLER`` value, it must be greater than zero and"
" less than 1. This is true for all ``Lab`` labels."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/nonlinear_options.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.nonlinear_options.NonlinearOptions.cnvtol:69
msgid ""
"The program may adjust the force convergence tolerance if you do not "
"explicitly set a value via :ref:`cnvtol`. See :ref:`Notes for details. "
"<CNVTOL_notes>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/nonlinear_options.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.nonlinear_options.NonlinearOptions.cnvtol:73
msgid "Specifies norm selection:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/nonlinear_options.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.nonlinear_options.NonlinearOptions.cnvtol:75
msgid ""
"``0`` - Infinite norm (check each degree of freedom separately) (default for"
" ``Lab`` = U and for ``Lab`` = TEMP when the iterative QUASI solver is used "
"( :ref:`thopt`,QUASI,,,,,,,1)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/nonlinear_options.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.nonlinear_options.NonlinearOptions.cnvtol:78
msgid ""
"The infinite norm is also used for the energy error criterion (ENGY) and is "
"the only option available for ENGY."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/nonlinear_options.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.nonlinear_options.NonlinearOptions.cnvtol:81
msgid "``1`` - L1 norm (check absolute value sum)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/nonlinear_options.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.nonlinear_options.NonlinearOptions.cnvtol:83
