msgid ""
"The pair-based dissipation energy (CFEN) and stabilization energy (CDEN) do "
"not include contributions from contact elements that are in far-field. The "
"pair-based strain energy (CTEN) does not include the frictional dissipation "
"energy and stabilization energy; it only contains an elastic recovery energy"
" when the contact status changes from closed to open."
msgstr ""

