#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.ocean.Ocean.ocdata:158
msgid "``VAL1`` - ``KWAVE`` -- The incident wave type:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/ocean.pydocstring of
