#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.ocean.Ocean.octable:73
msgid ""
"``CMy`` = Coefficient of inertia in the element y direction. If no value is "
"specified, and ``Cay`` is specified, this value defaults to ``Cay`` + 1.0. "
"If neither this value nor ``Cay`` is specified, both values default to 0.0."
msgstr ""

