" value defaults to ``CMy``. If neither this value nor ``CMy`` is specified, "
"and ``Caz`` is specified, this value defaults to ``Caz`` + 1.0. If neither "
"this value nor ``Caz`` is specified, both values default to 0.0."
msgstr ""

