"<https://ansyshelp.ansys.com/Views/Secured/corp/v232/en/ans_cmd/Hlp_C_OCTABLE.html#octablewavespectinput>`_"
" waves, the current profile is stretched or compressed linearly up to 10 "
"percent."
msgstr ""

