"Issue this command before defining your ocean load data ( :ref:`ocdata` or "
":ref:`octable` ). Define components before defining a component-type or a "
"pipe-type zone ( :ref:`oczone`,COMP or :ref:`oczone`,PIP, respectively)."
msgstr ""

