"This command is useful if you want to create the mapping data file without "
"issuing :ref:`save` or :ref:`cdwrite`, or if you want to specify that the "
"file be located in a directory other than your working directory. Also use "
"this command to manually load an existing mapping data file during a "
"restart. Distributed-Memory Parallel (DMP) Restriction This command is not "
"supported in a DMP solution."
msgstr ""

