"temperature specified by the :ref:`tunif` command to the temperature "
"specified by the :ref:`spctemp` command. For subsequent load steps, it ramps"
" from the previous value of the space temperature. For intermediate load "
"steps, use the :ref:`spctemp`,DELETE command and specify the space "
