msgid ""
"Defines a body-force load (such as temperature in a structural analysis, "
"heat generation rate in a thermal analysis, etc.) at a keypoint. Body loads "
"may be transferred from keypoints to nodes with the :ref:`bftran` or "
":ref:`sbctran` commands. Interpolation will be used to apply loads to the "
"nodes on the lines between keypoints. All keypoints on a given area (or "
"volume) must have the same :ref:`bfk` specification, with the same values, "
"for the loads to be transferred to interior nodes in the area (or volume). "
"If only one keypoint on a line has a :ref:`bfk` specification, the other "
"keypoint defaults to the value specified on the :ref:`bfunif` command."
