#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.solid_surface_loads.SolidSurfaceLoads.sfl:111
msgid ""
"If :ref:`kbc`,0 has been issued for ramped loads, the bulk temperature is "
"ramped from the value defined by :ref:`tunif` to the value specified by "
"``VALI`` and ``VALJ`` for the first loadstep. If tabular boundary conditions"
" are defined, the :ref:`kbc` command is ignored and tabular values are used "
"for the bulk temperatures."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/solid_surface_loads.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.solid_surface_loads.SolidSurfaceLoads.sfl:96
