#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.solid_surface_loads.SolidSurfaceLoads.sfl:116
msgid ""
"If ``Lab`` = RAD, ``VAL2I`` and ``VAL2J`` are the ambient temperatures."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/solid_surface_loads.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.solid_surface_loads.SolidSurfaceLoads.sfl:98
#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/solid_surface_loads.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.solid_surface_loads.SolidSurfaceLoads.sfl:118
msgid ""
"If ``Lab`` = RDSF, ``VAL2I`` is the enclosure number. Radiation will occur "
"between surfaces flagged with the same enclosure numbers. If the enclosure "
"is open, radiation will occur to the ambient."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/solid_surface_loads.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.solid_surface_loads.SolidSurfaceLoads.sfl:101
