msgid ""
"Defines PSD cospectral values to be associated with the previously defined "
"frequency points. Two table references are required since values are off- "
"diagonal terms. Unlike autospectra ( :ref:`psdval` ), the cospectra can be "
"positive or negative. The cospectral curve segment where there is a sign "
"change is interpolated linearly (the rest of the curve segments use log-log "
"interpolation). For better accuracy, choose as small a curve segment as "
"possible wherever a sign change occurs."
msgstr ""

