"Excited nodes farther apart than ``RMAX`` will be uncorrelated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/spectrum_options.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.spectrum_options.SpectrumOptions.psdspl:33
msgid ""
"Notes Defines a partially correlated excitation in terms of a sphere of "
"influence relating excitation point geometry (in a PSD analysis). If the "
"distance between any two excitation points is less than ``RMIN``, then the "
"excitation is fully correlated. If the distance is greater than ``RMAX``, "
"then the excitation is uncorrelated. If the distance lies between ``RMIN`` "
"and ``RMAX``, then the excitation is partially correlated with the degree of"
" correlation dependent on the separation distance between the points. This "
"command is not available for a pressure PSD analysis."
msgstr ""

