#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/spectrum_options.pydocstring
#: of
#: ansys.mapdl.core._commands.solution.spectrum_options.SpectrumOptions.rose:9
msgid ""
"Combine only those modes whose significance level exceeds the SIGNIF "
"threshold. For single point, multipoint, or DDAM response ( :ref:`spopt`, "
"SPRS, MPRS, or DDAM), the significance level of a mode is defined as the "
"mode coefficient divided by the maximum mode coefficient of all modes. Any "
"mode whose significance level is less than ``SIGNIF`` is considered "
"insignificant and does not contribute to the mode combinations. The higher "
"the SIGNIF threshold, the fewer the number of modes combined. ``SIGNIF`` "
"defaults to 0.001. If SIGNIF is specified as 0.0, it is taken as 0.0. (This "
"mode combination method is not valid for :ref:`spopt`,PSD.)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pymapdl/src/ansys/mapdl/core/_commands/solution/spectrum_options.pydocstring
